<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MALAKO</book>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="toc2">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwako Mopele ma Malako</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malako</para>
  <para style="imt">Eingeli</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku ɛ Malako ɛkomama boso ba Matie, Luka na Yoani ko edii ekuhe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngɔngɔ dja Malako osala nɔbɔ Poolo (12, 25), adiha midjɔ ma mbɛngɛ tina ɛ okoma Mwako Mopele odii Piɛlɛ ona ɔkɔmɛdjaka yo na omokomea mikanda (1 Piɛ 5, 13). Mwako Mopele ma Malako maenɛmɛdjaka boo yo mɛɛnɛ apaka tati ɛ midjɔ imaenɛ yo. Ainedja donga ibange boo Yesu adii «Mwana ɔ Ndjambe» (1, 1). Edii tina ɛkoma yo obuke diko la midjɔ imakɔɔ Yesu ko imainedjaka osooti ba Ndjambe onɔ midjɔ imabala yo. Akomea na onɔ badhimi ibadii pɛpɛ oda Bayuda.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Bileho ba Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 3:1-6">Mat 3, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-6">Luk 3, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-23">Yoa 1, 19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Hee edii mbangi ɛ Mwako Mopele ma Yesu Klisto, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Oko moda imakomama ta buku ɛ motɛli Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Nalomake moto ɔ mbai boso bawɛ, tina ɛ obɔngɛdja ndjia ɛ wɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Edi moholi ma moto ona ɔdumbeaka ta esobe boo: Bongɛdjani ndjia ɛ Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">ninodjani migase ma nde!»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Na bea, Yoani Mobatisi aenɛmɛ ta esobe; adumbeaka boo: «Hekodjani moda, batisamani ko Ndjambe ayɛɛlea masumu ma bono.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bato basusu ba Yuda na bato ba ibonga la Yelusalɛmɛ bakɛkɛ odi yo; bahuodjaka masumu ma bobo ohuu ko Yoani Mobatisi abainaka ta doa ɛ Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yoani Mobatisi alwaka esendja ena ɛkɔɔmɔ na ngungi dja kamela na mosenge ma eposo ɛ tito ta bongo; adaka aya ndoko na pɔki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Alehaka boo: «Ona ɔdoake ngɔngɔ dja mbai anɔini na ngulu; bea naboaniti noko osunama bo nalodjae mokɔli ma sapato dja nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mbai, naoinani na madiba, endolo yo, aoinaleani na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oinama na omekama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3, 13-4, 11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3, 21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Na bea, Yesu adonga ta Nasaleta, ngando ɛ Galilai, ko Yoani amoina ta dua ɛ Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />TA ehole einoa yo ta madiba, aenɛ busa bosadipoi ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke otita ta diko la nde elengɛɛ embenga. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ko moholi maokama donga busa boo: «Odii Mwana ɔmbai ɔ epaeli; nasepi na wɛ obuke.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Oko ena mbuku, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke maloma Yesu ta esobe. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Anɛngɛdja maswi tuku inei ta esobe ko amekama na Satana. Adaka esika emɔti na tito ba mokonda, ko babwɛndi bamopaka mia.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batingami banei ba mbangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4, 12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ngɔngɔ dja opeama ba Yoani Mobatisi ta bɔlɔkɔ, Yesu akɛɛ ta Galilai; atɔndɔkɔ Mwako Mopele ma Ndjambe <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />ko abalaka boo: «Ehole ekoki ko Okumu ba Ndjambe bodi mbuti! Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni moda mabono ko dhimani Mwako Mopele!» <verse eid="MRK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu adalaka ta okula ba ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai ehole ɛɛnɛ yo balubi babae, Simo na mwanango momi Andele, ibamaka modjanga ta ibeke inɛnɛ tin'ɛ bo badaka balubi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Kimananini ko nakɔlea boo oimeeni balubi ba bato.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Na mbala emɔti, basundola bihea ba bobo ko batingama na nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu adala maa ohali mɛnɛ ko aenɛ Djake na mwanango Yoani bana ba Djebedai. Badaka ta bwato ba bobo babɔngɛdja bihea. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ambuku Yesu ababea; bakina sangwabu Djebedai na basali ba nde ta bwato ko bakɛɛ engbanga na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto ɔtungeamaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4, 31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na batingami ba nde bakɛɛ ta ibonga la Kapalanauma. Ta iswi la sabata, Yesu aingea ta ndako ɛ miongɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda ko abanga oleha. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Bato iba mookaka bakamoaka na moda ma nde ma oleha; tin'ɛ boo aidaka elengɛɛ bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko, endolo alehaka na kpati. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ena bea, ta otei ba ndako ɛbobo ɛ miongɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda moto omɔti atungeamaka na mwembo mobe. Agama boo: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Ma wɛ na su nda, Yesu ɔ Nasaleta? Edoi wɛ alowa? Naodjebi opele boo odii: Mosɛnɔke ɔloma Ndjambe.» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu abala na kɛndjɔ mɛɛnɛ na mwembo ko amogamea boo: «Dipa monɔkɔ ma wɛ ko imana odi moto hoo!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mwembo mobe mamopukusa na ngulu ko maimana odii yo mopeli magama na moholi mopipo. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bato basusu, bakamoa ko basahɔdja boo: «Mu modjɔ nda? Moto hoo alehaka na moda ma yanie ko na kpati esusu! Adi obengana noko miembo mibe ko midi omosuma!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ko, na pɛpɛlɛ mɛɛnɛ gala ɛ Yesu ɛnangana ta Galilai esusu.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja bato ba bigo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4, 38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ɔimana bo ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda, bakɛɛ engbanga emɔti na Djake na Yoani, odii Simo na Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Okio ba Simo o mwali adaka asambi ta bwako, tin'ɛ boo adaka na mokuku mosa; ena ɔimea Yesu, babala na nde tin'ɛ mokɔni. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Asabatea mbuti na nde, amopea ta ebɔ ko amongɔdja. Mokuku mosa mamokina ko abanga obakɔmɛdja. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ɔimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, ngɔngɔ dja otita ba diso la busa, badoa odii Yesu na bato basusu ba bigo ko nabia ibadaka na miembo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bato basusu ba ibonga balumana ta boso ba edipako ɛ ndako. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu aheledja bato bike ibapekaka na bigo mindumba na mindumba ko abengana koko miembo mibe mike. Aipaka enɔli odii miembo mibe boo mabale, tina ɛ boo maamodjebaka.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali ta Galilai</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4, 42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Sɔɔ ɛ busa bokina, na hindihindi, Yesu aongɔ ko aimana ta ndako. Akɛɛ sokolu ɛ ibonga, ta esika ɛ pɛpɛ bato; ko oho, abanga oongɔnɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simo na bato ibadaka na nde bakɛɛ amohomba; <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />ehole emotanea bo, babala na nde boo: «Bato basusu baohombaka.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ko Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Lakɛɛni dɔngɔ ikina, ta ngando dja mbuti. Oho naboani koko oleha Mwako Mopele, ta elɔkɔ ɛ boo tina ɛdoa mbai iyena.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Na bea , akɛɛ ta Galilai esusu; aleha ta ndako dja miɔngɔnɔ dja Bayuda ko abenganaka miembo mibe.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja moto ɔ mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Moto ɔ mabha adoa odii Yesu, adaa na magundɛ boso ba nde ko amoongɔnɔ boo: «Okapala, ohɔni osɛnɔdjani.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu aluma na ndjokwa tina ɛ nde; aninodja ebɔ, amobinga ko abala na nde boo: «Napali, sɛnɔɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Oko ena mbuku, mabha masia ko asɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Na bea, Yesu amotuba matoi na ngulu ko amoyanedja. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Abala na nde boo: «Hokamedja opele, pɛpɛ otɔndɔ noko moto omɔti modjɔ mua. Endolo kɛɛ asainedjae odii nganga ɔ Ndjambe, ko pa epeeli moda maloma Mose, tina ɛ oinedja odii bato basusu boo oheli.»<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Moto ɔ mabha ayana, endolo abanga odjebedja mɔɔngɔ masusu gala ɛ mohelo ma nde. Ta tina ena, Yesu aiwaka hɔnɔ osaenɛmɛdja ta ibonga; adikamaka osokolu, ta bisika ba pɛpɛ bato. Ko bato odonga ta mɔɔngɔ masusu badoaka odii yo.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja etumbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ngɔngɔ dja baamaswi, Yesu asɔmbɔ ta Kapalanauma, ko ɛokama boo adaka ta ndako. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Emumu ɛ bato ɛbolama ta ndako, noko osokolu boso ba edipako esika ɛidaka. Yesu abaleha ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Bato banei badoa odii yo balwali etumbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Endolo baihɔnɔ oimea na nde odii Yesu tina ɛ bato bike. Bea batɔɔ iposi ta itɛlɔ diko la esika ɛdaka Yesu; na ndjia ena, batitedja etumbɛ ona ɔdaka asambi ta bwanga. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ehole ɛnɛ Yesu edhimeli ɛ bato bia, abala na etumbɛ boo: «Mwana ɔ mbai, masumu ma wɛ mayɛɛmi.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bakina bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko, badaka badii ena, balɛdjanaka ta tei ɛ milema ma bobo boo: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Tina ebali na moto hoo bea nda? Atuki Ndjambe. Ona ohɔni oyɛɛ masumu nda emiti daa Ndjambe yo buki!» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesu adjeba na mbala emɔti modjɔ malɛdjanaka bo ko abala na bu boo: «Odini na malɛi mia tina nda? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Enɔi na opɛtɛpɛtɛ obala na etumbɛ boo: “Masumu ma wɛ mayɛɛmi” Kaoko obala boo: “Ema, tomba bwanga bawɛ ko dala”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Endolo napalaka ɔdjebeni boo: Mwana ɔ moto adii na kpati ɛ oyɛɛ masumu ma ngondo.» Bea abala na etumbɛ boo: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Nabali na wɛ, emaa, tomba bwanga ba wɛ, ko sɔmbɔ odii wɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Mbala emɔti, ena ɔdaka bato basusu bamohokea, aemaa, atomba bwanga ba nde ko ayana. Bakamoa ibo basusu; bakumedja Ndjambe ko babala boo: «Lopakita enɛ modjɔ mondumba muu.»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5, 27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu asɔmbɔ ta lokula la ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai. Bato bike badoaka odi yo ko abalehaka. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ena ɔdaka yo anɔe, aenɛ Lewi, mwana ɔ Alafe, adii ta bilo ɛ nde ɛ oputedja puti. Yesu abali na nde boo: «Kimanani!» Lewi aema ko amokimana. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu ayaka ta ndako ɛ Lewi. Baputedjeli ba puti bike na bato ba masumu bayaka na nde ta mesa na batingami ba nde, tina ɛ boo bato bike ba moda mua bamokimanaka. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ko bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko ibadaka ta okala ba Bafalusai, ɔenɛbo boo Yesu ayaka na bato bia; babala na batingami ba nde boo: «Tina ndani adi oya na baputedjeli baputi ko na bato ba masumu?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu abaoka ko abala na bu boo: «Bato ba pɛpɛ bipeko tebakambe na monganga, endolo bato babipeko bakakambe na nde. Naidoa abea bato ibadii osaenɛ boo babɔngi, endolo tina ɛ bato ba masumu.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na osabekea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Iswi imɔti, batingami ba Yoani Mobatisi na Bafalusai basabekea. Bea bato bakɛɛ ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Tina ndani batingami ba Yoani Mobatisi na Bafalusai bakasabekee, endolo ibawɛ te bakoe bea?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Ko Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: Olɛdjakani boo bato ibakabee bo ta tɛkɛ ɛ moki bahɔni osabekea ehole edii bo engbanga na moomi ɔ moki? Pɛpɛ noko osinɛɛ! Ehole edii bo na moomi ɔ moki engbanga, batahɔnɔ osabekea. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Endolo basabekeabi ehole ebatombeabi bo moomi ɔ moki. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />«Moto atatonga yaale ɛ esendja ɛ tɛtɛli diko la esendja eyou; ekada bea yaale ɛ tɛtɛli hee etongi bo ekalalea esendja eyou bea okaleana bua bonɔlea na obe. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Moto atabonga vino ɛ yanie ta mbola dja kɔɔ bo na biposo ba tito biyou; ekada bea vino eolalea mbola djia, ko batakalea na mbola na vino koko. Titi bea! Tina ɛ boo vino ɛ yanie, eboani oko na mbola dja yanie!»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Iswi imɔti la sabata, Yesu akatisa gue ɛ ndongo. Batingami ba nde babanga obuka mingbɔndu ma ndongo ta mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bafalusai babala na Yesu boo: «Hokea, tina ndani batingami ba wɛ bakɔi modjɔ imosiami na mobeko ma boso ta iswi la sabata?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɔilangani modjɔ makɔ Davidi busa bomɔti ehole ɛoka yo ndja, yo na bato ibadalaka na nde? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Aingea ta ndako ɛ Ndjambe, ta ehole ɛ nganga ɔ Ndjambe monɛnɛ Abiatala ayaka mapa ma mabondja, imasiama na moto okina omaya, dongedja oko banganga ba Ndjambe, ko apa na bato ibadaka na nde.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Sabata ɛkɔɔmɔ tina ɛ moto; endolo moto aikɔɔmɔ tina ɛ Sabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Na tina hee djebani boo Mwana ɔ moto adii kumu mɛɛnɛ ɔ sabata.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja moto ta busa ba sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu asɔmbɔ koko ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda. Moto ɔ ebɔ ɛhɔlɔngɔnɔ adaka ena. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bafalusai batingea Yesu miso bɛngɛ baenɛ kaoko amoheledjalea ta iswi la sabata, bɛngɛ boo bamopunde. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu abala na moto ɔ ebɔ ɛhɔlɔngɔnɔ boo: «Emaa ena, boso ba bato basusu.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Na bea abala na bu boo: «Modjɔ moboani okɔmɔ ta iswi la sabata nda? Edhimami ta iswi la sabata okɔ opele kaoko obe? Oheledja kaoko oowa?» Endolo badaa ogoo. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu abahokea ibo basusu na miso ma ndjokwa; tin'ɛ balona osipoa. Abala na moto ona boo: «Ninodja ebɔ ɛ wɛ.» Ayeninodja ko ebɔ ɛ nde ɛhela. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bafalusai baimana ta ndako ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda badaa na boso Elode ikita tina ɛ obɔngɛdja moda moboani bo oowa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato bike badoi odii Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4, 23-25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:15-16">12, 15-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6, 17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu asasua na batingami ba nde ta lokula la ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai ko emumu ɛ bato ɛ mokimana. Bato badongaka ta Galilai na Yuda, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ta Idume, ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ dɔngɔ la dua ɛ Yolodani, ko mbuti na Tula na Sidona. Emumu ɛ bato ɛdoa odii Yesu tina ɛ boo baoka gala dja midjɔ misusu makɔkɔ yo. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Na bea abala na batingami ba nde babɔngɛdjae bwato, tin'ɛ boo bato basaka mombambamedja. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Na tina hee, elengɛɛ ɔheledjaka yo bato bike, basusu ibatungeamaka na bipeko bakɛɛ pɛpɛlɛ odii yo bɛngɛ boo bamobinge. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ko ehole emoenɛ bato ibatungeamaka na miembo mibe, basadumba ta mako ma nde ko bagama na ngulu boo: «Odii Mwana ɔ Ndjambe!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Endolo Yesu abasia na ngulu mɛɛnɛ boo batabala ta tina ɛ nde.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahɔi batingami doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu aihwea ta ikoli; abea bato ibapalaka yo, ko badoa odii yo. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ahɔɔ doomi na babae ibapa yo kombe ɛ ba apotele, bɛngɛ badae na nde ko abalome aleha Mwako Mopele, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na kpati tin'ɛ obengana miembo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ba apotele bia doomi na babae ibibi: Simo, ona ɔɔpa Yesu kombe ɛ Piɛlɛ –, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Djake na mwanango Yoani, ibo basusu bana ba Djebedai – Yesu abapa kombe ɛ Boanelegesi, ena etingodjaka boo: «Bato ibakoani na egbulumeli ɛ kake», <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Pilipo, Batelemi, Matie, Toma, Djake, mwana ɔ Alifa, Tade na Simo moto ookaswee ngando <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yudasi Isikalioti, ona okaba Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibota la Yesu ipali omotomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu asɔmbɔ ta ndako. Emumu ɛ bato ɛlumana koko na moda ma boo Yesu na batingami ba nde bataka noko enɔli ɛ oyaka. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ehole ɛoka bato ba ibota la nde gala ena, badoa amotomba na ngulu. Tin'ɛ babalaka boo: «Akɔni gbukele!»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbɛdjai diko la ipundaki la nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12, 22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12, 10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko iba donga ta Yelusalɛmɛ babalaka boo: «Belezebulu, djabulu, adii odi yo!» Naikina boo: «Edii kumu ɔ miembo mibe moto okamopɛ kpati ɛ obengana miembo mia!»<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Bea Yesu ababea ko abala na bu na mandjɛ boo: «Moda ndani Satana ahɔni osabengana yo mɛɛnɛ? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Okumu bomɔti bokabɔtɔɔ ta tei ɛ bu, botahɔnɔ oema; <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />ko bato ba ibota imɔti bakabɔtɔɔ ibo mɛnɛ, ibota dia itahɔnɔ oyeyoa. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ko ekada boo Satana asaonedjai yo mɛɛnɛ, kaoko akasakabana, ngulu ɛ nde etahɔnɔ oyeyoa endolo esialea.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Moto atahɔnɔ oingea ta ndako ɛ moto ɔ ngulu ko okatoa leka la nde, amiti nanga moto ona ɔ ngulu boso; ngɔngɔ dja omonanga na ngɔli, apundjalea leka la ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Nabali na nu edi sooti: bato bayɛɛmɛbi ta masumu ma bobo masusu ko na masingi imasinga bo Ndjambe. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Endolo moto akatuka Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ayɛɛmɛtebi noko osinɛɛ, tin'ɛ boo akwi ta isumu la seko.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu abadjebedja bea tin'ɛ babalaka ohuu boo: «Adii na mwembo mobe.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɛngɛmoto na bangɛnɛ ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nɛngɛ Yesu na bananango baimea; baema o sokolu ɛ ndako ko baloma moto amobea. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Bato bike badaka mbuti na nde ko bamotɔndɔ boo: «Hokamedja, ngwao na banangwao bali na bami badii o sokolu ko baohombaka.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Odii inga nda ko badii banainga banda?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Bea ahokea bato ibadaka bamohiki ko abala boo: «Hokea inga na banainga badi haa. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Tina ɛ boo ona ɔkɔkɔ opala ba Ndjambe adii mwaninga, ngɛnɛ kaoko inga.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mooneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu abanga koko oleha ta ekulu ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai. Emumu ɛ bato ɛbolama mbuti na nde, atitea ta bwato ko adaa ena. Bwato badaka botepi ta ibeke inɛnɛ ko bato badaka o ngondo, mbuti na madiba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Abaleha midjɔ mike na mandjɛ ko abala na bu ta eleho ɛ nde boo: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Hokamedjani! Busa bomɔti, mooneli akɛɛ ta gue ɛ nde boo aone. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ena ɔdaka yo amɛsɛ kona, ekenge ekina ɛkwa ta mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia: mbulu badoa ko badjikoma. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ekenge ekina ɛkwa ta mokpɔtɔ ma ndeke ena kpɔtɔ djaidaka inɛnɛ. Kona dja tɔɔ pɛpɛlɛ tina ɛ boo kpɔtɔ djaidaka na mbɛngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ehole eimana diso la busa, la tumba nguuku dja kona: dja hɔlɔngɔnɔ tin'ɛ otaka ba nginga. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ekenge ekina ɛ kona ɛkwa ta mele ma ndjubɛ. Mele mia makandoa ko makamamedja kona, djaibota mbuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Endolo ikina kona dja kwa ta mokpɔtɔ ma lobo; kona dja tɔɔ, djakandoa ko djabota mbuma: emɔti mbuma tuku isato, ekina tuku isamano ko ekina mokama.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ko Yesu abala boo: «Ona odii na matoi ma ooka, aoke!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ndani Yesu abali na mandjɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ehole ɛsasua Yesu na emumu, bato ibadaka na nde na batingami doomi na babae bamohɔdja tina ɛ mandjɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Abala na bu boo: «Ino ɔɔsoni mbombi dja Okumu ba Ndjambe, endolo odii bato basokolu mikabalame oko na mandjɛ, ko na bea<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />“Badii oindja endolo pɛpɛ oenɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Baokaka endolo pɛpɛ osipoa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Na bɔɔ ba boo basakasɔmbɔ odii Ndjambe ko asaka bayɛɛ!”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodjai tina ɛ indjɛ la mooneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8, 11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Na bea, Yesu abala na bu boo: «Otasipoakani indjɛ dia? Moda ndani osipoaleani mandjɛ makina masusu? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mooneli aoni ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bakina bato bakoani na mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia ena ɔkwa ebaeli: ngɔngɔ dja ooka ebaeli, oko ena, Satana adoi ko akatoi ebaeli hee ɛonama odii bo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bakina baosi kona ta mikpɔtɔ ma ndeke: oko ena ookibo ebaeli, bayedhimi pɛpɛlɛ na sepi. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Endolo bayekiniti boo ɛtɔe nginga odii bo, bayebanyei oko maa ehole mokuhe. Ko na bea, ta ehole ɛ monɔngɔ kaoko inyɔkɔli diko la ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe, basundoli edhimeli pɛpɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bato bakina koko baosi kona ta ndanda ɛ mele ma ndjubɛ: baoki ebaeli, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />endolo basatungei na midjɔ ma ngondo hee. Bahombi madiheli ma okosa ko na posa ikina isusu iingei ta tei ɛ bobo. Ta tina hee ebaeli ekamamai, ko etaki obota mbuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Kona ikina djaonama ta mokpɔtɔ ma lobo: edi bato ibaoki Ebaeli, bayeosi ko baboti mbuma, emɔti tuku isato, ekina tuku isamano ko ekina mokama.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la moinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8, 16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Bakaise moinda nase dja poke kaoko nase dja bwako? Tebamobakee diko la mesa ɛ mu? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Midjɔ misusu ma mbombi mienɛmɛbi ta boso ba bato bike, ko mbombi djisusu imanabi ta ohuu. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ona odi na matoi ma ooka, aoke!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Todingani na mii maokaka no! Ndjambe aoedjɛɛleani na edjɛɛli ɛdjɛɛkɛno bakina, ko akɔlea odii no onɔdja! <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Na tina hee, ona odi na maa eka adihalea onɔ; endolo ona odii pɛpɛ eka bakatualea noko okɛkɛ ibodi na nde.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la kona ekakandoe yo buki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu abala na koko boo: «Hokea eka ekoani na Okumu ba Ndjambe: moto adumbi kona ta gue ɛnde. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Moto ona ahwɛɛ kaoko adae mɔsu, bulu na moi, kona etɔi ko ekandoi pɛpɛ odjeba moda modi yo. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Mokpɔtɔ imo mɛɛnɛ mopi mbuma: esanga eimani boso, ngɔngɔ djia mongbɔndu, ta suka mbuma djiboloi ta mongbɔndu. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Oko ena okpeti mbuma, moto abangi mosala na mbɛli ɛ nde, tina ɛ boo ehole ɛ obuka mbuma ekoki.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mbuma ɛ sinapi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu abala koko boo: «Eka ndani ehɔni na su okokanedja Okumu ba Ndjambe? Indjɛ ndani iboani na su obokokanedja? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Bakoani na mombuma ma sinapi; ehole ɛ mooni bo ta mokpɔtɔ , modii mokɛkɛ mɛɛnɛ onɔ mbuma djisusu dja ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Endolo ngɔngɔ dja omoona, mokandoi ko monɔi mele misusu ma gue na onɛnɛ. Motɔdjai bitape binɛnɛnɛ ko mbulu ba diko bahɔni oyoa meepu ma bobo ta esii ɛ mu.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu alehaka na mandjɛ mike ma mondumba mua; okimana na moda mohɔni bato osipoa. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesu aibalaka na bu pɛpɛ mandjɛ, endolo ehole ɛdaka yo buki na batingami ba nde, abatingodjaka midjɔ misusu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asii lungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mɔkɔmɔkɔ ma busa bua, Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Lapendeni ta ngunda ekina ɛ ibeke.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ngɔngɔ dja oyanedja bato, batingami basɔmbɔ na Yesu ta bwato ibadaka yo ko babanga okatisa imelo la ibeke. Mato makina madaka mbuti na nde. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Oko ena ambuku lungu ɛlinda, mula masamaka ta bwato, bwato mbuti na oluma na madiba. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu, adaka ta mbaka ɛ ngɔngɔ, ahwɛli, ena molo mobaki diko la ekomba. Batingami ba nde bamongɔdja ena bagama boo: «Molehi, lodoi agwa: modjɔ mua, motaobaleka noko eka?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Ɔongɔ Yesu, agamea lungu ko abali na madiba ma ibeke inɛnɛ boo: «Daa ogoo! Pɔpɔnɔ!» Lungu esi ko ogoo bonɛnɛ baboloa. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Bea Yesu abala na batingami boo: «Tina ndani odini na bɔɔ? Opakita dhimani oko?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Endolo bada na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ ko basabaleana ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Moto ho adi nda, noko lungu na ibeke inɛnɛ badi omosuma?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔdaka na miembo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na batingami ba nde baimei ta ngunda ekina ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai, ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ma ba Gelasenia. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Oko idubua la Yesu ta bwato, moto omɔti aimani ta makila ko adoa asaka na nde. Moto ona apeamaka na mwembo mobe. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Odie ba nde badaka ta makila, ko pɛpɛ moto omɔti ɔhɔnɔkɔ omonanga, noko na monyɔɔlɔ; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />mbala djike, bamoisaka bibende ta mako na minyɔɔlɔ ta mabɔ, endolo atswaka minyɔɔlɔ ko abukaka bibende. Pɛpɛ moto ɔdaka na ngulu ɛ omoika. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Bihole bisusu, bulu na moi, adaka oko alebalebe ta makila na ta diko la makoli, apeli agame ko ena asabenedjae yo mɛɛnɛ na ndeke. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ehole ɛ enɛ yo Yesu ohali; apeta ebango, akwa magunda boso ba nde, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />ko agama na ngulu boo: «Ma wɛ na mbai nda, Yesu, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe Onɔi Diko? Naongɔɔni na ingbangba ta kombe ɛ Ndjambe, pɛpɛ otungeani oko!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />– Tin'ɛ Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mwembo mobe, imana odii moto hoo!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu amohɔdja boo: «Kombe ɛ wɛ nda?» Asɔmbɛdja boo: «Kombe ɛ mbai edii “Bike”, tina ɛ boo lodii iso bike.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ko amongɔɔnɔ na ingbangba boo atabaloma osokolu ɛ ngando. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Na bea bwela bonɛnɛ ba ngulu badaka ena, mbuti na ngomba, bahomba mia ma oya. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Miembo mibe maongɔɔnɔ Yesu boo: «Loloma otei ba ngulu, lokina laingee odi bo!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu abapa enɔli. Na bea miembo mibe maimana odii moto ona ko maingia odii ngulu. Bwela ba ngulu bosusu – mbuti na ngulu koto ibae – bahilingoana ta mokpukulu ma ngomba basasopa ta ibeke inɛnɛ ko badinda. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Babaneli ba ngulu batia ko bakɛɛ ananganedja gala ta ibonga na ta bimbangu. Bato badoa aenɛ moda manɔɔ modjɔ mua. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Baimea mbuti na Yesu ko baenɛ moto ona ɔdaka na miembo mibe mike: adii na manɔkɔ, alwali bisendja ko yongi ɛ nde esɔmbi. Ko badaa na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bato ibaenɛ modjɔ mua moda manɔɔ mo babatɔndɔ moda mahela na moto ɔdaka na miembo mibe ko na isolo la bwela ba ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Na bea babanga oongɔnɔ Yesu adonge ta ekenge ɛ bobo ɛ mokpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ehole ɛtitea Yesu ta bwato, moto ona ɔdaka na miembo mibe aongɔɔnɔ Yesu boo adikame odii yo. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu aidhima boo akɛɛ nɔbɔ nde, endolo abala na nde boo: «Sɔmbɔ odii wɛ, ta ibota la wɛ, ko batɔndɔ midjɔ misusu diko la opele bokomɛi Kumu ko na moda mookei yo ndjokwa.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Moomi ona asɔmbɔ ko abanga otɔndɔ ta mabonga doomi midjɔ misusu makɔɔ Yesu tina ɛ nde; ko bato basusu ibamooka baluma na okamoa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana mwali ɔ Yailo na mwali ɔbinga esendja ɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu asɔmbɔ na bwato ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke inɛnɛ, ko bato bike babolama mbuti na nde. Adaka ta ekulu ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Omɔti ɔ bakumu ba ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda, adoa. Kombe ɛnde Yailo. Aeni Yesu, akwi na magunda ta mako ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Ko amoongɔɔnɔ na ingbangba boo: «Mwana ɔ mbai mwali adii mbuti na ogwa, dua ta mobakee mabɔ bɛngɛ boo epeko ɛsie ko adae na mohelo!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu akɛɛ na nde engbanga emɔti. Bato bike bamokimana ko bamombambamedja mɔɔngɔ masusu.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Na bea mwali omɔti adaka ena, ona ɔimanaka makia mbua doomi na babae. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Aenɛ minganga bike, salo ɛbobo ɛimoheledja; abeedja odiheli ba nde bosusu, pɛpɛ ohela; endolo ego engalaka oko ongala. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mwali ona aoka moda mabalaka bo tin'ɛ Yesu. Adoa ta ndanda ɛ bato bike, sangɔngɔ dja nde, ko abinga esendja ɛnde. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Tinɛ asabaleaka boo: «Nakabinga noko bisendja ba nde, nahelalea.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Oko ena ambuku, makia makina oimana ko asaoka bo aheli ta epeko ɛ nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Yesu aoka oko ta ehole ena, boo ngulu emɔti eimani ta tei ɛ nde. Ahombana ta ndanda ɛ bato bia bike ko ahɔdja boo: «Obingi bisendja ba mbai nda?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Batingami na nde bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Oenɛkɛ bato bike baombambamedjai mɔɔngɔ masusu, ko ɔhɔdjaka boo: “Obingini ndani?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Endolo Yesu ahokea mbuti na nde tina ɛ odjeba ona okɔi modjɔ mua. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Mwali angongoma na bɔɔ tinɛ adjeba modjɔ mokɔɔmi odii yo; adoa asadumba ta mako ma Yesu ko amotɔndɔ sooti esusu. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mwana ɔ mbai mwali, odhima ba wɛ booheledjai. Kɛɛ na ogoo ko hela na ego ɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Oko ena ɔdaka Yesu abala bea, bato ba ndako ɛ kumu ɔ ndako ɛ miongɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda baimea ko babala na nde boo: «Mwana ɔ wɛ mwali agwi. Tina ɛ otungea koko Molehi nda?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Endolo Yesu aibakea molema ta mibalo ma bobo ko abala na kumu ɔ ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda boo: «Pɛpɛ obanga, dhima oko odhima.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu aipa enɔli odi moto omɔti bo akɛɛ na nde, dongedja oko Piɛlɛ, Djake na mwanango Yoani. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Baimea ta ndako ɛ kumu ɔ ndako ɛ miongɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda, oho Yesu atanea bato na moyeke monɛnɛ, bayea ko bagama na ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Aingea ta ndako ko abala na bu boo: «Tin'ɛ moyeke mu mosusu ko na bie bii nda? Mwana agwiti, ahwɛli hiɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Endolo bamosɛkɛ. Bea aimanedja bato basusu osokolu, atomba oko sango, nango na batingami basato, ko aingea ta ekenge ɛ ndako ɛ mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Apea ebɔ ɛ mwana ko abala na nde boo: «Talita kumi!» Etingodjai boo: «Yɛngɛ mwali, nabali na wɛ, emaa!»<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Na mbala emɔti mwana mwali aema ko abandi odala – tin'ɛ boo adaka na mbua doomi na babae. Ena ambuku, bato basusu badaa na okamoa bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Endolo Yesu abatuba matoi boo batatɔndɔɔ bato modjɔ mua; bea abala na bu boo: «Mopani mia ma oya.»<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bato ba Nasaleta baloni odhima Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4, 16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu akina esika ena ko akɛɛ ta Nasaleta ta ibonga ilakandoa yo; engbanga emɔti na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ta busa ba sabata, abanga oleha ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda. Bato bike ibamookaka bakamoa obuke. Babalaka boo: «Odihi yo midjɔ mii misusu hɔɔ? Ona ndani omopa owɛi buu na kpati ɛ okokedja midjɔ ma okamoa moda muu? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Yo titi sapate, mwana ɔ Malia, mwɛngɛ Djake, Yosɛse, Yuda ko na Simo? Ko bananango bali batahelaka na su haa?» Ko midjɔ mia mabasia boo batamodhima. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Na bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Motɛli tadhimame ta ekomi ɛ nde, denga la nde na ibota la nde.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu aikɔ ekamodjɛli emɔti, dongedja oko obakea mabɔ ma nde diko la ekenge ɛ bato ba bigo ko abaheledja. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu akamoa na taka ɛ edhimeli ɛ bato ba ibonga la nde.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu alomi batingami doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10, 5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu adala ta ngando isusu dja mbuti mbuti tin'oleha. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Abea batingami doomi na babae ko abanga obaloma babae na babae. Abapa kpati ta diko la miembo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Abala na bu boo: «Pɛpɛ otombani eka tina ɛ mwɛngɔ, dongedja oko pango; pɛpɛ otombani mapa, pɛpɛ tɔmbi, pɛpɛ falanga ta ibenga. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Lwani sandale, endolo pɛpɛ otombani bisendja bibae.»<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Abala koko na bu boo: «Ehole eosɔleani bo ta ndako, daani oko ena mbunoko oimana ba boono. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Ekada boo bato ba ngando emɔti baloni oosɔni kaoko ookani, dongani ena ko pupolani mbumbu dja mako ma bono: edalea ekebedjɛli tin'ɛ bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii embete ɛ mabɔtɔ. Etingodjai boo molomami aditi na eka ekina ɛ okɔ odii bato ibalomama yo, noko na mbumbu dja ibonga dia djitadika djikali na sapato dja nde.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Batingami bakɛɛ ko baleha bato boo basɔmbotɔne moda ma mohelo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Babengana miembo mibe mike ko baheledja bato ba bipeko bike ngɔngɔ dja obasua munɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogwa ba Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Na bea, kumu Elode aoka gala ɛ Yesu, ta elokɛ boo kombe ɛ nde ɛokama mɔɔngɔ masusu. Bakina babalaka boo: «Yoani Mobatisi apusoi ta tei ɛ bago! Na tina ena adii na kpati ɛ okɔ midjɔ ma okamoa.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bakina babalaka boo: «Edii Elia.» Bakina koko babalaka boo: «Edii Motɛli, omɔti moda ma batɛli ibayou.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ehole ɛoka Elode midjɔ mia misusu imabalamaka, asabalea boo: «Edii Yoani Mobatisi! Namolenedja molo, endolo asɔmbi ta mohelo!» <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Tin'ɛ boo, Elode apedja Yoani ko bamomaa ta bɔlɔkɔ, anangi na monyɔɔlɔ. Ɛdaka tina ɛ osepedja Elodiade, mwali ɔ mwanango Pilipo ɔɔsɔ yo. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Tina ɛ boo Yoani abala na Elode boo: «Ebɔngiti na wɛ bo ɔtombe mwali ɔ mwangwao!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodiade aluma na swɛ ɛ Yoani ko apalaka amowoe, endolo aihɔnɔkɔ okokedja posa ɛ nde. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Na bea, Elode adaka na bɔɔ ba Yoani, ena ɔdjebaka yo boo adaka moto ɔ odjoo ko mosɛnɔke, ko amobaneaka. Ehole ɛ mokaka yo, atungeamaka; endolo apalaka oko omooka. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Na bea, enɔli epele ɛɛnɛmɛ odii Elodiade ehole eimea iswi la tɛkɛ ɛ Elode tina ɛ olɛdja obotama ba nde. Abea bakumu ba ngando, basoda bapɛtɛ dja diko na bakulaka ba Galilai. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwana mwali ɔ Elodiade aingea ko abua ngɔmɔ; asepedja Elode na bato babea yo ta tɛkɛ. Bea kumu Elode abala na yɛngɛ mwali boo: «Ongani eka epalaka wɛ, ko naopalea yo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Ko alena seleka tina ɛ nde boo: «Naopalea eka esusu eongalea wɛ, noko ekadaa ekenge ɛ okumu ba mbai.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Yɛngɛ mwali aimana ko ahɔdja nango boo: «Eboani mbai oonga yee?» Nango amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Onga molo ma Yoani Mobatisi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Yɛngɛ mwali asɔmbɔ pɛpɛlɛ odii kumu ko amoonga boo: «Napalaka opɛni hadɛdi ta saani molo ma Yoani Mobatisi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Kumu aoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ ta molema ma nde; endolo tina ɛ seleka elena yo boso ba bato babea yo ta tɛkɛ, aihɔnɔ omoima. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Mbala emɔti kumu aloma omɔti ɔ basoda ba nde tina ɛ omolwɛ molo ma Yoani Mobatisi. Soda akɛɛ ta ndako ɛ bɔlɔkɔ ko alena molo ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Adoa na mu ta saani, amopa yɛngɛ mwali ko yo amopa odii nango. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ehole ɛoka batingami ba Yoani gala ena, badoa atomba ndjemba ɛ nde ko bayepusea ta esɛmɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayakedjai bato koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-15">Yoa 6, 1-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:1-18">Mal 8, 1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Ɔhula bapotele ta elomu ɛ bobo badoa mbuti na Yesu ko bamotɔndɔ midjɔ misusu imakɔɔ bo na imaleha bo. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Na bea, bato bike badaka bakɛ bahula ko Yesu na batingami ba nde batakaka noko ehole ɛ oyaka. Yesu abala nabu boo: «Doani engbanga emɔti na mbai lasasue ta esika ɛ pɛpɛ bato bɛngɛ ɔhemeni maa osinɛɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Na bea, batitea ta bwato ibo mɛɛnɛ bɛngɛ boo bakɛɛ ta esika ɛ pɛpɛ bato. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Endolo bato bike babadjeba ko basipoa esika ɛkɛkɛ bo; badonga ta ngando dja mbuti mbuti pɛpɛlɛ ko baimea na mako ta esika ɛkɛkɛ bo boso ba Yesu na batingami ba nde.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ehole ɛduboa Yesu ta bwato, aenɛ bato bike; molema ma nde maluma na ndjokwa ta tin'ɛ bato bia, tina ɛ boo badaka elɛngɛ bwela ba bhata ibotaki mobanyeli. Ko abanga obaleha midjɔ mike. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Ɔtita busa, batingami ba nde basabatea na nde ko babala na nde boo: «Esika hee edii esobe ko busa bobangi odipa. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Sɔmbɛdja bato bii ta ngando dja mbuti mbuti odii bato ibadii na gue bɛngɛ boo bakɛɛ asomba mia ma oyaka.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Bapani mia ma oyaka ino mɛɛnɛ!» Babala na nde boo: «Ɛpalaka wɛ boo lakɛɛ asomba mia ma oya na pata dja falanga mikama mibae ko labapɛ bayake?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Odini na mapa meka? Kɛɛ aindjeni.» Ngɔngɔ dja oindja, bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Lodii na mapa matano, na swi babae.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Bea abala na bu boo badedjae bato basusu bibole na bibole diko la ndjani dja mɔsu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bato badaa milɔngɔ ma bato mokama na mikina ma bato tuku itano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Na bea, Yesu atomba mapa matano na swi babae, angangodja miso ta busa ko asakoa Ndjambe. Abuka mapa ko amapa odii batingami bɛngɛ bo bamakaane odii bato. Akabana koko swi babae odii ibo basusu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bato basusu baya ko bagola. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ko batingami batuta bikenge bamapa na swi ibadikaa, ko balumedja mapole doomi na mabae. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Bato ibaya mapa badaka bami koto itano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali diko la madiba</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14, 22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6, 15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Oko ena ambuku, Yesu atitedja batingami ba nde ta bwato bɛngɛ ibo basuake boso ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke, dɔngɔ la ibonga la Betesaida, ena ɔdaka yo mɛɛnɛ ayanedja emumu ɛ bato. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ngɔngɔ dja oyanedja bato, akɛɛ diko la ngomba tina ɛ oongɔnɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ɔimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, bwato badaka ta ndanda ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ, ko Yesu yo mɛnɛ adaka o ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ɔenɛ yo boo batingami badaka na monɔngɔ ta oduka, tina ɛ boo mopɛpɛ mabasɔmbɛdjaka ngɔngɔ; ta eyɛɛ busa, Yesu abakimana ena adale ta diko la madiba, ko apalaka bo abanɔdjae. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ehole ɛ moenɛ bo adale ta diko la madiba ma ibeke inɛnɛ, balɛdja boo ɛdaka mongɔli ko bahwea mingɔli. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Tina ɛ boo ibo basusu bamoenɛkɛ, bayeketana na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. Mbala emɔti abala na bu boo: «Sapingedjani! Edii mbai; pɛpɛ obangani!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ngɔngɔ djia atitea ta bwato, mbuti na bu, ko mopɛpɛ masia. Batingami bakamoa obuke mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Tin'ɛ boo baisipoa modjɔ ma okamoa ma mapa: badaka elengɛɛ bigegele.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja bato ba bipeko ba Genesalɛte</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14, 34-36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:22-25">Yoa 6, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ngɔngɔ dja okatisa ibeke, baimea ta ibongu la Genesalɛte ko basɛmɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ehole ɛduboabo ta bwato, mbala emɔti, bato badjeba Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Bato bakɛɛ pɛpɛlɛ ngise djisusu ko babanga odoa na bato ba bipeko diko la maanga, badoa na bu ta esika ɛokakabo boo Yesu adi ena. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Mɔɔngɔ masusu makɛkɛ Yesu, ta mabonga, ta ngando, kaoko odii bato ba gue, bato badoaka asambea bato ba bipeko ta bisika ba masaka ma bato ko bamoongɔnɔkɔ bo abakine babinge noko mopɛpɛ ma mokoto ma nde; bakɔni basusu ibaa mobingaka bahelaka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na okɔkɔ ba Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bafalusai na bakina bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko badonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ babolama mbuti na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Baenɛ bakina batingami ba Yesu bayaka mia na mabɔ mbindo, etingodjai boo: pɛpɛ ososa mabɔ okimana na okɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Na tina hee, Bafalusai na Bayuda bakina basusu bakasume mibeko mabakinea bakɔkɔ ba bobo: te bayɛ mia pɛpɛ ososa mabɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ko ta ehole ekahule bo ta bisika ba masanga, te bayake mia boso ba osasɛnodja. Bakasume mibeko mikina mike ma okɔkɔ, elengɛɛ moda mopele ma ososa kɔbɔ, poke, masaso ma bibende na bisambe. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Bafalusai na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko bahɔdja Yesu boo: «Tina ndani batingami bawɛ tebasume mibeko malokinea bakɔkɔ ba boso, endolo bakayake mia ma bobo na mabɔ mbindo?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Isaya atɛlɛ ohuu miako ma Ndjambe ta tina ɛ bono, bato ba owɛi bobe, elengɛɛ okoma yo boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Bato bii badii okumeani oko na monɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">endolo milema ma bobo midii ohali na mbai.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Losambo lokasambeleni bato bii loditi na tina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">ti ngasa bileho bikalehe bo bidii etoko mibeko ma bato.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Ino osundolini mobeko ma Ndjambe, ko osapini na okɔkɔ ba bato! <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Na bea Yesu abakea boo: Odumbini mobeko ma Ndjambe tina ɛ obanea okɔkɔ ba bono mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Na tina hee Mose abala boo: “Suma sangwao na ngwao”, ko na ikina: “Ho obalalea obe na sango kaoko na nango, aboani na etumbu ɛ ogwa.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Endolo ino okaleheni boo ekada moto akabala ohuu na sango kaoko na nango boo: “Epeeli ekɔki mbai naopɛ nayepi odii Ndjambe”, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />oditi opani enɔli odii mwana boo akɔe opele odii sango kaoko odii nango. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Na moda mua, odini odongedja ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe tina ɛ okɔkɔ ibodii no oleha. Ko odini okɔ midjɔ mike ma moda mua.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midjɔ imikaimedjae moto mbindo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15, 10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu abea koko bato bike odii yo ko abanga obala boo: «Hokamedjanini, ino asusu, ko sipoani modjɔ muu. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Pɛpɛ eka ekahule sokolu ɛ moto ehɔni omoimedja mbindo ekaingea ta tei ɛ nde. Edii ena ekaimane ta tei ɛ moto ekamoimedjae mbindo. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Hokamedjani opele, ekada boo odini na matoi maooka!]»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ehole ɛ kina Yesu emumu ɛ bato ko ɔingea yo ta ndako, batingami ba nde bamohɔdja tina ɛ indjɛ dia. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Abala na bu boo: «Na ino koko, otakini owɛi? Otadjebakani boo eka ekadonge osokolu ko eingei odii moto etahɔnɔ omoimedja mbindo, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />tina ɛ boo leka lua teloingee ta molema ma nde, endolo ta tei ɛ sɔpɔ dja nde, ko ngɔngɔ djia lokei ta ibela?» Na mibalo mia, Yesu abala ohuu boo mia masusu madii ma oya. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Ko abala koko boo: «Edii eka he ekaimane ta tei ɛ moto yo iyena ekamoimedjae mbindo. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Tin'ɛ boo edii ta tei ɛ moto, malɛi mabe makamolome ahelama ta midjɔ mibe, oiba, oowa, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />bɔɔli, bipalapala, otɔmbɔ, okosa, ohela ta wusuwsu, oda na ikuwa, obalea baminawɛ obe, osakumea na olole. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Midjɔ mibe mii misusu mikadonge ta molema ma moto ko mikamoimedjae mbindo.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali mokɛndɛli adhimei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu akina ena ko akɛɛ ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Tula. Aingea ta ndako emɔti ko aipala moto omɔti adjebe boo adaka ena, endolo aihɔnɔ osabomba. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Na tina hee, mwali omɔti ɔ ngando ena mwana ɔ nde atungeamaka na mwembo mobe, aoka gala ɛ Yesu ko adoa pɛpɛlɛ odii yo ko akwa ta mako ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mwali ona aidaka Moyuda, abotama ta Fenisi ɛ Sulia. Aongɔɔnɔ Yesu boo abengane mwembo mobe odii mwana ɔ nde mwali. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Endolo Yesu abala na nde boo: «Peta kina bana bagole boso; elɔkɛ boo editi opele otomba mapa ma bana tin'ɛ omapa odii mva.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mwali ona amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Na bea, Kumu, noko bana ba mva, ta tina dja mesa, bakayake opele mbumbu dja mapa ikadumbe bana.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Na bea Yesu abala na nde boo: «Ta tina ebaeli ɛ wɛ, yana: mwembo mobe moimani ta tei ɛ mwana ɔ wɛ mwali.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ehole eyana yo ta ndako ɛ nde, atanea mwana asambi ta bwako: mwembo mobe maimana odii yo.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja moto ɔ ohoka ko emimi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 15:29-31">Mat 15, 29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu akina ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Tula, anɔɔ ta Sidona okimana ndjia ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai ko akatisa ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Mabonga Doomi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Badoa odii yo na moto ɔ ohoka ko na kaka ta obala, ko bamoongɔɔnɔ boo abakee ebɔ diko la nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu akɛɛ na nde yo buki, ohali na esika ɛdaka emumu ɛ bato; aisa sapi ta matoi ma nde, atɔɔ masɔi ko amobinga elemi na masɔi ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu aihwedja miso ta busa, ahemana ko abala na nde boo: «Efata» Etingodjai boo: «Sadipoa!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Mbala emɔti, matoi ma nde masadipoa, elemi ɛ nde etingoa ko abanga obala opele. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu abakola matoi boo batatɔndɔ moto omɔti modjɔ mua; noko ɔbakola yo matoi, badaka oko bananganedja gala ɛ nde na onɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ko bato bakamoa obuke mɛɛnɛ; babalaka bo: «Misusu midii yo okɔ midii mipele! Noko bato ba ohoka badi ooka ko bimimi badii obala opele!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayakedjai bato koto inei</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15, 32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ta maswi mia, emumu ɛ bato ɛbolama koko. Bato baidaka na eka ɛ oyaka. Na bea Yesu abea batingami ba nde ko abala na bu boo: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Nadii na ndjokwa ɛ emumu hee ɛ bato, tin'ɛ boo bakɔi na mbai maswi masato pɛpɛ eka ɛ oyaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nakabayanedja ndja ta madie ma bobo, baembɛlea na ndjia, tina ɛ boo bike ta ndanda ɛ bobo badongi ohali.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Batingami ba nde bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Loboani odiha ta esobe mapa ma obayakedja bo bagole hɔɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Odini na mapa meka?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Saambo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Na bea, abala na emumu ɛ bato boo badae ta kpɔtɔ. Atomba mapa mia saambo, asakoa Ndjambe, amabukakaki ko amapi odii batingami ba nde boo bamakaane odii bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Badaka koko na ekenge ɛ ba swi bakɛkɛkɛ. Yesu asakoa Ndjambe tin'ɛ swi bia ko abali na batingami ba nde babakaane koko. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Bato basusu baya ko bagola. Batingami batuta bikenge ba mia ibadikaa ko balumedja mapole saambo. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Na bea, bato basusu badaka ena mbuti na koto inei. Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abayanedja. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Oko ta ehole ena Yesu atitea ta bwato engbanga emɔti na batingami ba nde ko akɛɛ ta ekenge ɛ ngando ɛ Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalusai bahɔdjai embete ɛ okamoa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bafalusai baimea ko babanga oboma kitɛ na Yesu bɛngɛ bamopekee nduka. Bamohɔdja boo ainedjae embete ɛ okamoa donga odii Ndjambe. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu aoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ ta tei ɛ mwembo ko abala boo: «Tina ndani bato bayangola hee badii ohɔdja embete ɛ okamoa? Nabali na nu sooti boo: pɛpɛ noko embete emɔti epamabi tin'ɛ bobo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ngɔngɔ djia abakina, atitea koko ta bwato ko akatisa ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɛngɛ mapa ma Bafalusai na Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16, 5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Batingami babosa otomba mapa, badaka oko na ipa imɔti ta bwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu abakebedja boo: «Ongatanani! Sasuani na nɛngɛ mapa ma Bafalusai ko na nɛngɛ mapa ma Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Batingami babanga osabaleana ta ndanda ɛ bobo tin'ɛ baidaka na mapa. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu adjeba malei ma bobo ko abahɔdja boo: «Tina ndani ɔsabaleakani ta ndanda ɛ bono boo otakini mapa? Opakita sipoani oko? Opakita peani? Owɛi ba boono bodii oko bodipamake? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Odini na miso, ko toenɛni? Odini na matoi, ko tookeni? Oditi olɛdjanani: <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />ehole ɛbuka mbai mapa matano tin'ɛ bato koto itano, otombani mapole malumake ma tikaika meka?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Doomi na mabae.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />«Ko ehole ɛbuka mbai mapa saambo tin'ɛ bato koto inei, ɔtombani mapole malumake na bikengakengi meka?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Saambo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Na bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Opakitasipoani oko?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔ miso mago ta Betesaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu aimea ta Betesaida na batingami ba nde. Bato badoa odii yo na moto ɔ miso mago ko bamoongɔɔnɔ boo amobinge na ebɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu apea moto ɔ miso mago ta ebɔ ko akɛɛ na nde osokolu ɛ ngando. Bea amotɔɔ masoi ta miso, abakea mabɔ diko la nde ko amohɔdja boo: «Oeni eka?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Moto ɔ miso mago aihwedja miso ko abala boo: «Naenɛkɛ bato, nabaenɛkɛ elengɛɛ mele, endolo badii odala.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu abakea koko mabɔ diko la miso ma nde; ehole ɛmadipoa yo aenɛ opele mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Yana odii wɛ ko pɛpɛ oingea noko ta ngando.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ abali ohuu bo Yesu adii Masia</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:67-71">Yoa 6, 67-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu akɛɛ na batingami ba nde ta ngise ɛ ngando dja mbuti na Sezale ɛ Pilipo. Ena ɔdaka bo badale na ndjia, Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Bato bakabale boo mbai nadii nda?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Bakina bakabale boo wɛ odii Yoani Mobatisi, bakina boo odii Elia ko bakina koko boo, odii omɔti ɔ batɛli.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Endolo ino obalini boo mbai nadii nda?» Piɛlɛ amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ odii Masia.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu abatuba matoi na ngulu boo batatɔndɔɔ noko moto omɔti modjɔ mua.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai ogwa na opusoa ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16, 21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu abanga opa eleho hee odii batingami ba nde: «Eboani boo Mwana ɔ moto aoke saya enɛnɛ; basuku bangando, bakumu banganga ba Ndjambe na bato baedjebeli ɛ mibeko bamodumbalea; bamoowalea, ko ngɔngɔ dja maswi masato, asapusoalea ta ogwa.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Abala na bu midjɔ mia ta ohuu. Na bea Piɛlɛ amokoli oyɛlɛ, abangi omopɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Endolo Yesu ahombana, ahokea batingami ba nde, apɛlɛ Piɛlɛ na ngulu boo: «Donga ohali na mbai, Satana, tina ɛ boo otalɛdjaka elengɛɛ Ndjambe endolo elengɛɛ bato.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu abea emumu ɛ bato engbanga emɔti na batingami ba nde ko abala na bu boo: «Ekada moto akapala okimanani, asalone yo mɛɛnɛ, alwae ekulusu ɛ nde ko akimaneni. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Tina ɛ boo, ona opalaka oheledja mohelo ma nde amobungedjalea, endolo ona obungedjalea mohelo ma nde ta tina ɛ mbai ko ta tina ɛ Mwako Mopele, amoheledjalea. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Kito ndani edii na moto akadiha ngondo esusu, ekada boo abungedjai mohelo ma nde mɛɛnɛ? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ehɔni yo opa bɛngɛ boo asombe mohelo ma nde yee? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Na tina hee, ona odii na sɔni na mbai ko na mibalo ma mbai boso ba bato bayangola hee, bato ba masumu na batɔmbɔki ta boso ba Njambe, bea Mwana ɔ moto koko amokeabi sɔni, ta ehole edoabi yo ta ekumu ɛ Sango engbanga na babwɛndi basɛnɔke.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Nabali na nu sooti boo: Bato bakina ibadii haa bagwɛtelea boso ba oenɛ odoa ba Okumu ba Ndjambe na ngulu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekumu ɛ Yesu ta ngomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17, 1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswi masamano, Yesu atomba Piɛlɛ, Djake na Yoani, akɛɛ na bu ta diko la ngomba eyai oho badaka oko ibo mɛɛnɛ. Yesu aenɛmɛ na ekumu boso ba bobo; <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />bisendja ba nde baimea bipu ko bangɛngɛkɛ na moda ma boo moto omɔti haa ta kpɔtɔ atahɔnɔ obipuedja mondumba mua. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Sasimo, batingami basato baenɛ Elia na Mose basoola na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Piɛlɛ abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, enɔi opele boo ladae haa. Lapike bitondo bisato, emɔti tina ɛ wɛ, emɔti tin'ɛ Mose ko ekina tina ɛ Elia.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Na bea, Piɛlɛ aidjeba eka ɛobala tin'ɛ boo yo mɛɛnɛ engbanga na baminande babae badaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Itute la doa ko labahua na esii ɛ lu, ko moholi maokama ta tei ɛ itute boo: «Ho adi Mwana ɔ mbai ɔ epaeli, mookani!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Oko ta ehole ena batingami bahokea mbuti na bu, endolo baienɛ noko moto omɔti; oko Yesu yo mɛɛnɛ adaka na bu. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ena ɔdaka bo batite ta ngomba, Yesu abatuba matoi boo batatɔndɔ noko moto omɔti midjɔ imieni bo, mbunoko iswi ipusuabi Mwana ɔ moto ta ndanda ɛ bato bago. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Babanyea ebaeli ena, endolo basahɔdjaka ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Osapusoa ta ndanda ɛ bago, etingodjai yee?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Bahɔdja Yesu boo: «Tina ndani bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko badii obala boo eboani Elia adoe boso?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii sooti, Elia aboani adoe boso tin'osɔmbɛdja midjɔ misusu ta molongo. Endolo tina ndani ɛkomama koko boo Mwana ɔ moto aokalea saya enɛnɛ ko aenɛmɛlea ngasa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ta tina ɛmbai, nabali na nu boo: Elia adoa ehele, ko bato bamonɔngɛdja elengɛɛ ɔpalaka bo okimana moda imakomama ta tina ɛ nde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai mwana ɔdaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17, 14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9, 37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ehole eimea bo mbuti na batingami bakina, baenɛ emumu ɛ bato ɛ bahika ko bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko badaka babomeana nabu kitɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ena ɔenɛ bato bia Yesu, ibo basusu bakamoa ko bakɛɛ ebango bɛngɛ bamoisie. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu ahɔdja batingami ba nde boo: «Eka ɛbomeanaka no na bu kitɛ nda?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Moto omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bato bia amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Molehi, nadoi na mwana ɔ mbai odii wɛ, akatungeame na mwembo mobe imokamosie boo atabala. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Bisika bisusu bikamopee mwembo mua, mokamodumbe ta kpɔtɔ, mapuli makaimwane na nde ta monɔkɔ, akakpɛkɛne mino, ko mokuku ma nde mokandindime. Naongɔɔni batingami ba wɛ boo bamobengane, endolo bahɔniti omoimusedja.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Bato ba taka ɛ edhimeli! Mbunoko ehole ndani naboani odikama nanu? Mbunoko ehole ndani nalwalea mandi ma boono? Doani na mwana.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Badoa na nde odii yo. Ɔenɛ mwembo mobe mua Yesu, mapukusa mwana na ngulu; mamodumba ta kpɔtɔ, abilingana ko aimusedja mapuli ta monɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu ahɔdja sango boo: «Mondumba ma modjɔ mu monɛngɛdjai na nde maswi meka?» Ko sango amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Donga obwɛngɛ ba nde. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mbala djike mwembo mua mobe mokamodumbe ta mosa kaoko ta madiba bɛngɛ boo mamowoe. Endolo lookea ndjokwa ko doa alokɔmɛdjae, okapala!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Tina ebali wɛ boo okahɔnɔ okɔ maa modjɔ? Endolo, midjɔ misusu miboani okokedjama odii moto ona odhimi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Oko ta ehole ena, sɛngɛ mwana agama na ngulu boo: «Nadhimi, kɔmɛdjani, tin'ɛ bo nadii na taka ɛ edhimeli!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ɔenɛ Yesu bato bike bapete ebango mbuti na bu; bea, agamea mwembo mobe ko abala na mu boo: «Mwembo mokaimedjae moto emimi na ohoka, nabali na wɛ: imana odii mwana hoo ko pɛpɛ osɔmbɔ koko odii yo!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mwembo mobe magama, madumba mwana na ngulu, ko maimana. Mwana aimea elengɛɛ moto mogo, bato bike babala boo: «Agwii.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Endolo Yesu amopea ta ebɔ, amoemedja ko mwana aema. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ta ehole ɛsɔmbɔ Yesu ta ndako, ɔdikaa batingami ibo mɛɛnɛ na nde bamohɔdja boo: «Tina edai so pɛpɛ ohɔnɔ obengana mwembo mua nda?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ko Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii oko na ndjia ɛ miɔngɔnɔ mwembo mobe ma mondumba mua mohɔni oimana.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai koko ogwa na opusoama ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Badonga ena ko bakatisa ta Galilai. Yesu aipala boo bato badjebe esika ɛdaka yo. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Hokea moda malehaka yo batingami ba nde; abalaka na bu boo: «Mwana ɔ moto akabamalea ta mabɔ ma bato, bamowalea; ko ngɔngɔ dja maswi masato, apusualea ta ogwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Endolo batingami baisipoa tingo ɛ bibaeli bia ko badaka na bɔɔ ba omohɔdja mahɔdja.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto ɔ boso ta ndanda ɛ batingami nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ehole ɛimeabo ta Kapalanauma, ta ndako, Yesu ahɔdja batingami ba nde boo: «Modjɔ modakino ɔwelanani na ndjia nda?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Endolo batingami bapɔpɔnɔ, tin'ɛ boo, na ndjia, bawelanaka diko la odjeba moto ɔ boso ta ndanda ɛ bobo. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Na bea Yesu adaa, ababea ibo basusu doomi na babae ko abala na bu boo: «Ekada boo omɔti ɔ bono apalaka oda moto ɔ boso, eboani na nde osaenɛ moto odii ngɔngɔ dja bato basusu ko mosali ɔ bato basusu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Bea atomba mwana mokɛkɛ, amoemea ta ndanda ɛ bobo, amopea ta mabɔ ma nde ko abala na bu boo: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Moto ndani oosi yɛngɛ mokɛkɛ elengɛɛ hoo ta kombe ɛ mbai, aosi mbai mɛɛnɛ; ko hoo odii oosɔni, aositi mbai, endolo aosi ona ɔlomani.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ona odii pɛpɛ oda moloni ɔ boso adii ɔ boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9, 49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yoani abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, loeni moto omɔti abengana miembo mibe na kombe ɛ wɛ, ko lomosii, tin'ɛ boo aditi omɔti ɔ booso.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Endolo Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ omosiani, tin'ɛ boo moto atahɔno okɔ ekamodjɛli na kombe ɛ mbai ko ngɔngɔ dja ma ehole abale obe tin'ɛ mbai. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Tin'ɛ moto ona odi pɛpɛ ololona, adii tin'ɛ booso. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nabali na nu sooti, moto ona oopabini kɔbɔ ɛ madiba ma omwa ta ɛlokɛɛ boo odini bato ba Klisto, adihabi ibondja la nde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okeba tina ɛ odumba moto ta isumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18, 6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Endolo ekada boo moto omɔti adumbi ta isumu mwana omɔti odii bii bakɛkɛ ibadhimeini, enɔi opele tina ɛ nde omɔtingea mondeke monɛnɛ ta dɔli ko bamodumbe ta ibeke ilinɔi na onɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ekada boo ebɔ ɛ wɛ edii odumba ta isumu, yelena, enɔi opele bo ɔingie ta mohelo ma seko ebɔ emoti, endolo titi ɔingie ta gena mabɔ mabae ta mosa muu ma pɛpɛ odimea. [<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Oho, ngusu ibaka nyɛɛ mikuku tebagwe ko mosa temodimee.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ekada eko ɛ wɛ edii oloma ta isumu, yelena, enɔi opele oingia ta ngando ɛ mohelo ma seko na eko emɔti, ta esika ɛ boo baodumbe ta mosa ma gena na mako mabae. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Oho, “ngusu ibaka nyɛɛ mokuku tebagwɛ ko mosa temodimee”.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ko ekada diso la wɛ likaodumbe ta isumu, lidongedja, enɔi opele oingea na diso imɔti ta Okumu ba Ndjambe ta esika ɛ boo oingie ta gena na miso mabae. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Oho, “ngusu ibakanyɛɛ mikuku ma bato tebagwɛ ko mosa temodimee”. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Tingasa , moto mosusu anɔbi ta mosa bɛngɛ adihe ngɛngɛ elengɛɛ mokwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mokwa edii eka epele; endolo mokataka okpaa, eka ndani ehɔnɔlea omosɔmbɛdja boo maimee mopele? Dani na mokwa ta tei ɛ boono mɛɛnɛ ko dani na ogoo ta ndanda ɛ boono.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho ɛ Yesu diko la odonga ba mwali ta moki</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu akina esika ɛdaka yo ko akɛɛ ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Yuda, ta dɔngɔ la dua la Yolodane. Emumu ɛ bato ɛbolama koko mbuti na nde ko abanga oleha, moda mokakɔe yo. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bakina Bafalusai badoa odi yo bɛngɛ boo bamomeke. Bamohɔdja boo: mobeko ma booso mokape enɔli odii moomi boo adongedjae mwali ɔ nde ta moki? <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja na ihɔdja dii boo: «Mobeko maopani Mose nda?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Basɔmbɛdja boo: «Mose apa enɔli odi moomi boo akome mokanda tin'ɛ owa moki.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Mose akoma mobeko mua tin'ɛ boono elokɛɛ odini na molema mopipo. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Endolo ta ibange ehole ɛyoa Ndjambe leka losusu, abayoa mwali na moomi, <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />na tina hee moomi akinabi sango na nango tina ɛ okataana na mwali ɔ nde, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ko ibo babae baimiabi moto omɔti. Na bea, baditi koko bato babae, endolo muni momɔti. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Yɛɛ boo moto adae pɛpɛ obɔtɔdja ena ɛputoanedja Ndjambe.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ta ehole ɛsɔmbɔ bo ta ndako, batingami bahɔdja koko Yesu mahɔdja diko la modjɔ mua. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ekada boo moomi adongedjai mwali ɔ nde ta moki ko aosi okina, akɔi bɔɔli na mwali ɔ nde ɔ boso; <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />edi oko moda momɔti, ekada boo mwali omɔti aowoi moki ma nde ko abali moomi okina, akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjongoi bana</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bato badoa na bana odii Yesu bɛngɛ boo ababakee mabɔ, endolo batingami baba pɛlɛ na ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ehole ɛɛnɛ Yesu bea, asuboa ko abala nabu boo: «Kinani bana bakɛkɛ badoe odii mbai, pɛpɛ obasiani, tina ɛ boo Okumu ba Ndjambe bodii tina ɛ bato badii elengɛɛ ibo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nabali na nu sooti: moto ona odii pɛpɛ oosɔ Okumu ba Ndjambe elengɛɛ mwana mokɛkɛ, ahɔnetebi oingea ta bu.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ngɔngɔ djia atomba bana ta mabɔ ma nde; abakea mabɔ diko la omɔti na omɔti ko abadjongoa.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Modiheli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ena ɔdaka Yesu adale ta ndjia, moto omɔti amokimana ebango, akwa magunda boso ba nde ko amohɔdja boo: «Molehi mopele, eboani mbai okɔ ye bɛngɛ nadihe mohelo ma sekoo?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Tina ɛ beakani wɛ mopele nda? Moto mopele aditi dongedja oko Ndjambe yo buki. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Odjebi mibeko mii: “Pɛpɛ owa moto; pɛpɛ okɔ bɔɔli, pɛpɛ oiba, pɛpɛ opa tati ebe tin'ɛ minɔ, pɛpɛ otomba leka la ba minɔ na epulu; suma sangwao na ngwao.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Moto ona amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Molehi, nakasume mibeko mia misusu donga obwɛngɛ ba mbai.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu amohokea ko amopala, abala na nde boo: «Otaki eka emɔti: kɛɛ atɛkɛ leka losusu lodii na wɛ ko pa ikondja odii batundu, na bea odabi na odiheli ta busa; ngɔngɔ djia dua ko tingama na mbai.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Endolo ehole ɛoka moto ona bea, mokuku ma nde maembɛ ko ayana na ndjokwa enɛnɛ ta molema, tin'ɛ boo adaka na odiheli bonɛnɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu ahokea batingami ba nde ibamohikaka ko abala na bu boo: «Edii opipo odi badiheli oingea ta Okumu ba Ndjambe!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Batingami basatungea obuke diko la bibaeli bia. Endolo Yesu abala koko na bu boo: «Bana ba mbai, edii opipo tin'ɛ oingea ta Okumu ba Ndjambe! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Edii opɛtɛpɛtɛ tin'ɛ kamela oingea ta iposi la tonga, endolo enɔi na opipo tin'ɛ modiheli oingea ta Okumu ba Ndjambe.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Batingami bakamoa obuke onɔ, ko basahɔdjana ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Na bea ona ohɔni ohela nda?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu abahokea ko abala na bu boo: «Mua modi bato pɛpɛ oboana okokedja, editi bea odii Ndjambe, tin'ɛ boo Ndjambe adii okokedja midjɔ misusu.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Na bea Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Hokamedja, iso lasundola leka la booso losusu boo laokimane.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabalaka na wɛ sooti boo: ekada boo moto akini, tin'ɛ mbai ko tin'ɛ Mwako Mopele, ndako ɛ nde, kaoko bananango bami, bananango bali, nango, sango, bana ba nde, gue dja nde, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />adiabi ndese mbala mokama onɔ ehole hee edii so hadɛdi: ndako, bananango bami, bananango bali, banango, bana ko gue, engbanga emɔti na minɔngɔ koko; ko ta ngondo ɛdoake, aosɔbi mohelo ma sekoo. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Endolo bike ibadii hadɛdi bato ba boso badabi bato ba ngɔngɔ, ko bii ibadii hadɛdi bato ba ngɔngɔ badabi bato ba boso.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai mbala ɛ basato ogwa na opusoa ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Badaka na ndjia ta ikɛ la bobo ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Yesu adalaka boso ba batingami ba nde, ibadaka na okɛsɛli, ko bato ibabakimanaka badaka na bɔɔ. Yesu abea na koko batingami ba nde doomi na babae, abanga obala na bu modjɔ mokɔmɔlea na nde ngɔngɔ dja maa ehole mokɛkɛ: <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Abala na bu boo: «Hokamedjani, lokɛi ta Yelusalɛmɛ, oho Mwana ɔ moto akabamalea ta mabɔ ma bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko. Bamopalea etumbu ɛ ogwa ko bamokabalea ta mabɔ ma bapangano. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bamotaalea, bamotɔlea masɔi, bamobomalea pimbo ko bamoowalea. Ko ngɔngɔ dja maswi masato, apusoalea.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛngɛ ɛ Djake nɔbɔ Yoani</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20, 20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Na bea Djake na Yoani, bana bami ba Djebedai babatama na Yesu. Babala na nde boo: «Molehi, lapalaka boo ɔkɔe tin'ɛ booso modjɔ mapalaka so boo laosɛngɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ɔpalakani naokɔeni yee?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ehole eimeabi wɛ ta ekumu ɛ wɛ ɛ gala, lopa bisika ba oda mbuti na wɛ, omɔti ta ebɔ ɛ wɛ ɛ bami, okina ta ebɔ ɛ wɛ ɛbali.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: «Otadjebakani modjɔ masɛngɛkɛno. Ɔhɔnini omwa kɔbɔ emwalea mbai kaoko oinama iboinamalea mbai?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ko bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Lohɔnɔlea.» Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Sooti, omwaleani kɔbɔ emwalea mbai ko odihaleani oinama ibodihalea mbai. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Endolo ibondo la oda ta ebɔ ɛ mbai ɛ bami kaoko ta ebɔ ɛ mbai ɛ bali editi modjɔ ma mbai, bisika bia edii Ndjambe moto ɔbibɔngɛdja tin'ɛ bato bia ibapabi yo.» <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ehole ɛoka batingami bakina doomi modjɔ mua, basuboa na Djake na Yoani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Na bea Yesu ababea ibo basusu ko abala na bu boo: «Ɔdjebakani opele boo bato bii bakaenɛme elengɛɛ bakumu ba mabota, bakamakondje. Ko bato ba ekumu bakanɔngɛdjae bato ibadii nase dja bobo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Endolo etakɔmɔ bea ta ndanda ɛ bono. Na otikoana, ona ɔpalaka adae moto ɔ ekumu ta ndanda ɛ boono, adalea mosali ɔ boono. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Ko omɔti ɔ bono akapala bo adae moto ɔ boso, aboani oda mobuli ɔ bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Tin'ɛ boo Mwana ɔ Moto yo mɛɛnɛ aidoa boo bamosalee, endolo adoa tin'ɛ osalea na opa mohelo ma nde elengɛɛ motwuia tin'ɛ isiko la bato bike.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai Balatimayo moto ɔ miso mago</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesu na batingami ba nde baimea ta ibonga la Yeliko. Ehole ɛimana bo ta ibonga na emumu ɛ bato, moto ɔ miso mago ɔbeakabo Balatimayo, mwana moomi ɔ Time, adaka ta mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia ena asɛngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ɔɔka yo boo ɛdaka Yesu ɔ Nasaleta, abanga ogama: «Yesu, Mwana ɔ Davidi, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bato bike bamosia boo adae ogoo, endolo yo agama koko na ngulu mɛɛnɛ: «Mwana ɔ Davidi, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu aema ko abala boo: «Mobeani.» Babea moto ɔ miso mago ko babala na nde boo «Sapingedja, emaa, Yesu aobeaka.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ɔɔka yo bibaeli bia adumba mokoto ma nde, asapimbodja ko akɛɛ odii Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu amohɔdja boo: «Ɔpalaka nakɔe yee ta tin'ɛ wɛ?» Moto ɔ miso mago amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Molehi, kɔɔ bo naenɛ koko.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Kɛɛ, edhimeli ɛ wɛ eoheledjai.» Oko ta ehole ena abanga oenɛ opele ko akimana Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aingei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ehole ɛ batama bo na Yelusalɛmɛ, mbuti na Betefadje na Betania, dɔngɔ la ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive. Yesu asuakedja batingami ba nde babae: <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />«Kɛɛni ta ngando enaho edii boso ba boono. Ehole eimealeano ena, otanealeani mwana ɔ punda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Punda hoo adii tito mokɛkɛ, akakɔmɛdjae tina ɛ olwa </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mina.</char></note> atingi ta mole, moto omɔti apakiti abakama ta diko la nde. Motingoani ko doani na nde haa odii mbai. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ekada boo moto aohɔdjaini boo: “Ɔkɔkɔni bea tina nda?” Mosɔmbɛdjani boo: “Kumu akambaka na nde, endolo pɛpɛ ekoka amosɔmbɛdjalea oko haa.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bakɛɛ ko batanea mwana ɔ punda, atingi osokolu mbuti na edipako, ta ndjia. Bamotingoa. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Bato bakina ibadaka ena babahɔdja boo: «Mua makɔkɔno nda? Tina ɛtingoaka no mwana ɔ punda hoo nda?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Batingami ba basɔmbɛdja moda mabala Yesu, ko babakina bo bakɛɛ na nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Batomba mwana ɔ punda bakɛɛ na nde odii Yesu; babakea bisendja babobo diko la punda, ko Yesu adaa ena. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bato bike batanda bisendja ba bobo ta ndjia, ko bakina batanda bitape ba mele bamosu ibakɛsɛ bo ta gue. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bato ibadalaka boso ba Yesu na bii ibamokimanaka osangɔngɔ bagamaka boo: «Ozana! Yɛɛ boo adjongoame ona odoi ta kombe ɛ Kumu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Yɛɛ boo Ndjambe adjongoe okumu ibodoi, okumu ba Davidi sangwasu! Ozana ta bisika ibinɔi diko!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu aingea ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko akɛɛ ta tepelo. Ngɔngɔ dja ohokea midjɔ imanɔkɔ mbuti na nde, aimana ko asɔmbɔ ta Betania engbanga na batingami ba nde doomi na babae, tin'ɛ boo eimiaka mɔkɔmɔkɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aniedjai mole ma figi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti, ehole ɛimana bo ta Betania, Yesu aoka ndja. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aenɛ ohali mole ma figi imadaka na kasa, ko akɛɛ amohokea kaoko moboani oda na mbuma; endolo ehole eimea yo mbuti na mole, atanea oko kasa ngasa, tina ɛ boo ɛidaka edidi ɛ mu ɛ obota mbuma. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Bea Yesu abala na mole ma figi boo: «Yɛɛ boo moto omɔti adae pɛpɛ oyaka koko mbuma dja wɛ!» Batingami ba nde baoka modjɔ mua.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ngɔngɔ djia baimea ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Yesu aingea ta opango ba tepelo ko abanga obengana bato ibatɛkɛkɛ na bia ibasombaka ena. Akalimodja mesa dja bato ibasɔmbɔtɔnɔkɔ falanga na bigboto ba batɛki ba bimbenga. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Ko aikina noko moto omɔti boo atombe eka akatise na yu tepelo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Bea abanga obaleha modjɔ muu boo: «Ɛkomama boo: “Ndako ɛ mbai ebeamabi ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ tin'ɛ mabota masusu.” Endolo ino, oyeimedjaini ndako ɛ baibi.» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe bike na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko ɔɔkabo modjɔ mua bahombaka moda ndani ma oowa Yesu; endolo badaka na bɔɔ ba nde tin'ɛ boo bato bike bakamoaka na bileho ba nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ehole ɛ tita busa, Yesu na batingami ba nde baimana ta ibonga.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mole ma figi imahɔlɔngɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21, 20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ehole ɛya busa, ena ɔdaka bo banɔe ta itilinga la ndjia, baenɛ mole ma figi: mahɔlɔngɔnɔ mosusu mbunoko ta nginga. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Ko Piɛlɛ alɛdjana diko la modjɔ imanɔɔ, ko abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, hokea, mole ma figi mu imalakedjabi wɛ mohɔlɔngɔni mosusu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Bea Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Nabali na nu sooti: daani na edhimeli odi Ndjambe! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Kaoko moto akabala na ngomba hee boo: “Donga ena, ko sadumba ta ibeke ilinɔi na onɛnɛ”, ko amiti daa na kitɛ ta molema ma nde, akadhima boo modjɔ mobali yo modii okɔɔmɔ, mokɔmɔbi bea ta tina ɛ nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Na tina hee nabali na nu boo: Ehole ɛ ongɔnɔkɔ no tin'ɛ osɛngɛ eka odii Ndjambe, dhimani boo osidjaini oyediha ko eka ena epamalea odino. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Ko ehole emai no diko tina ɛ oongɔnɔ, okada na modjɔ na mino, moyɛɛ, bɛngɛ Tata ɔ boono ona odii odiko aoyɛɛni koko ta obe ba boono. [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Endolo omiti yɛɛni bato bakina, Tata ɔ bono odii odiko aoyɛɛtebini ta mabunga ma boono.]»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔdonga kpati ɛ Yesu hɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Basɔmbɔ koko ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Ehole ɛdaka Yesu akɛɛ ko asɔmbɔ ta tepelo, bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na basuku ba ngando badoa mbuti na nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bamohɔdja boo: «Na kpati ɛ ndani ɔkɔkɔ midjɔ mii? Ona osaopa kpati ɛ omiko nda?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Naohɔdjakani ihɔdja imɔti; okalisɔmbɛdjani, bea naodjebedjaleani na kpati ɛ ndani nakɔkɔ midjɔ mii. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Ona ɔloma Yoani boo aine nda? Ndjambe kaoko bato? Sɔmbɛdjanini.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Endolo babanga opana malɛi, basabaleaka boo: «Lokasɔmbɛdja boo: “Edii Ndjambe moto ɔmoloma”, alohɔdjalea boo: “Tina ndani oidhimeani Yoani?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Endolo lokasɔmbedja boo: “Edii nde bato bamoloma...”?» – Badaka na bɔɔ ba bato bike tin'ɛ boo ibo basusu badhimaka boo Yoani adii motɛli ɔ sooti. – <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Bea basɔmbɛdja Yesu boo: «Lotadjeba.» Ko Yesu abala boo: «Mbai ko natadjeba otɔndɔni na kpati ɛ ndani nakɔkɔ midjɔ mia.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la basali babe ba gue ɛ vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abanga obala na bu na mandjɛ boo: «Moto omɔti aona gue ɛ mele ma vino; ayehika na opango, alongea mombɔndɔ tina ɛ okamola mbuma dja vino ko apika ndako eyai ɛ bato ba oyebanyea. Ngɔngɔ djia aisa basali ba oyeputela ko akɛɛ ta mwɛngɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ehole ɛkpeta mbuma dja vino, aloma mosali ɔ nde omɔti odii ba baputeli ba gue boo aosɛ odii bo ɛ nde ekenge ɛ mbuma dja gue ɛ vino. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Endolo baputeli bia ba gue bamopea, bamoboma ko bamoyanedja mabɔ bwase. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Moswa gue abalomea mosali okina; bamoboma ta molo ko bamosinga. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Abalomea koko mosali okina, ko, ona, bamoowa; ko bakɔɔ moda momɔti na basali bakina bike: baboma bakina ko baoowa bakina. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Moto omɔti odikaka na moswa gue oko mwana ɔ nde ɔ epaeli. Yo moto ɔ suka ɔbalomea yo, ɛlɔkɛ alɛdjaka boo: “Badalea na isuma tin'ɛ mwana ɔ mbai.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Endolo baputeli ba gue basabaleana boo: “Hokeani mosangoli! Doani, lamoowoe, ko lasangoe gue!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Bapea mwana ɔ moswa gue, bamoowa ko badumba ndjemba ɛ nde sokolu ɛ gue ɛ vino.» <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Eka ndani ehɔni okɔ moswa gue? Adoabi, aowabi baputeli ba gue ɛ vino ko ayepabi odii baputeli bakina. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Opakita langani Ikomi dia boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Ikwee iladumba bayoli ba ndako</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">laimea ikwee la ndonga.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mua imodongi odii Kumu, modii tin'ɛ booso, modjɔ ma okamoa!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na basuku bahombaka ndjia ɛ opea Yesu tin'ɛ badjeba boo abala indjɛ dia ɛlɔkɔ ɛ bobo. Endolo badaka na bɔɔ ba bato bike ibadaka ena; bamokina ko bayana.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oputa puti odii Kaisala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ngɔngɔ djia baloma ekenge ɛ Bafalusai ko na bato ba Elode odii Yesu bɛngɛ boo bamodihe na ibunga diko la kɔpɛ ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Badoa abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, lodjebi boo okabale midjɔ na osooti; toise molema odii moto; na tina hee, tohokee mbanda dja bato, endolo okalehe bileho ba Ndjambe ba sooti. Lotɔndɔɔ, mobeko ma booso modii opa enɔli ɛ oputa puti odii Kaisala? Loboani bo lapute kaoko pɛpɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Endolo, Yesu adjeba boo babombi midjɔ ta milema ma bobo, na bea abala na bu boo: «Tina ɛ mekakani na nu nda? Lwɛnini pata ɛ falanga emɔti bɛngɛ boo na ye enɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Badoa na pata ɛ falanga emɔti odii yo, ko Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Mbanda hee na kombe hee ɛkoma bo haa, ɛ nda?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɛ kumu Kaisala.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Na bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Pani Kaisala ibondo la nde, ko pani odii Ndjambe la nde ibondo.» Ko bakamoa na esɔmbɛdjɛli ɛ nde.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdja diko la opusoa ba bato</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Bakina Basadukai badoa odii Yesu. Bato bia bakabale bo bato iba bagwa bapusoetebi. – Bamohɔdja moda muu boo: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Molehi, Mose akoma tin'ɛ boso boo: “Ekada boo moomi, ona odii na mwanango moomi, agwi ko akini mwali ɔ ogwa ona odaa na nde pɛpɛ obota, eboani boo yɛngɛ ɔ nde abale mwali ɔ gwedja moomi bɛngɛ boo akɔe mbota tina ɛ mowei.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Na bea, ibota imɔti ladaka na bana bami saambo. Mwana ɔ boso aosɔ mwali ko agwa pɛpɛ obota. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mwana ɔ babae aosɔ mwali ona ɔgwa na moomi ko aibota na nde. Ɔbasato oko moda mua, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />ko ibo basusu saambo basangoa mwali ona motete ko bagwa pɛpɛ okina bana. Ngɔngɔ dja ibo basusu, mwali agwa koko. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ta opusoama ba bato, yo adabi mwali ɔ nda? Tin'ɛ boo ibo basusu saambo badaa na nde moki!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Odini ta ndanda ɛ ibunga; otadjebakani na Makomi, na ngulu ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Tin'ɛ boo, ehole epusoabi bato, bami na bali baosɔnetebi, endolo badabi ta busa elengɛɛ babwɛndi. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ta modjɔ ma opusoa ba bato, opakitini alanga ta mokanda ma Mose isolo la mole muu madaka mosa mayoa? Ndjambe abala na Mose boo: “Nadii Ndjambe ɔ Abalayama, Ndjambe ɔ Isaka na Ndjambe ɔ Yakobo.” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: Ndjambe adii Ndjambe ɔ bato ba mohelo endolo aditi Ndjambe ɔ bato bago. Na bea, odini ta ndanda ɛ ibunga.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobeko monɔi mibeko misusu na tina</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Moto ɔ edjebeli ɛ mibeko abaoka baboma kitɛ. Yo aenɛ boo Yesu asɔmbɛdja opele odii Basadukai; abatama mbuti na Yesu ko amohɔdja boo: «Mobeko monɔi mibeko misusu nda?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Hokea Mobeko monɔi mibeko misusu imumu: “Hokamedja, Isalɛlɛ! Yawɛ Ndjambe ɔ boso adii oko omɔti. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Pala Yawɛ, Ndjambe ɔ wɛ na molema ma wɛ mosusu, na molimo ma wɛ mosusu, na owɛi bawɛ bosusu ko na ngulu ɛ wɛ esusu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ko hokea mobeko ma babae imumu: “Oboani ɔpale mina wɛ elengɛɛ okasapale wɛ mɛɛnɛ.” Mobeko mokina ma onɔ mii mibae moditi.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Na bea, moto ɔ edjebeli ɛ mibeko abala na Yesu boo: «Edii bea, Molehi! Muu mobali wɛ modii sooti: Ndjambe adii oko omɔti, okina aditi. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Omopala na molema mosusu, na owɛi bosusu, na ngulu esusu, na opala mino elengɛɛ okasapale wɛ mɛɛnɛ. Mua monɔi bipeli bisusu ba opa Ndjambe na mbeka dja tito.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu ɔenɛ yo boo moto ɔ edjebeli ɛ mibeko amosɔmbɛdja opele, abala na nde boo: «Wɛ oditi ohali na Okumu ba Ndjambe.» Ngɔngɔ djia, pɛpɛ moto omɔti ɔdaa koko na kaso boo amohɔdjae mahɔdja makina.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masia na Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ehole ɛdaka Yesu aleha ta tepelo, ahɔdja ihɔdja dii boo: «Moda ndani bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko bahɔni obala boo Masia adii ta mbota ɛ Davidi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Tin'ɛ boo ɔlɔndɔmɔ Davidi, na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, abala yo mɛɛnɛ boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Yawɛ abala ohuu na Kumu ɔ mbai boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Dua, daa haa ta ebɔ ɛ mbai ɛ bami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Mbunoko nadedjae baloni ba wɛ nase dja bigbota ba wɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Davidi yo mɛɛnɛ adii omobea “Kumu”. Moda ndani Masia ahɔni oda Mwana ɔ nde?» Ko bato bike bamookaka na sepi.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedja bato bike tin'ɛ bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu alehaka bato basusu boo: «Angatanani na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko bapali odala na mikoto miyai, bakapale babaiseake ndese dja ekumu ta bisika bidii bato bike osaka; <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />bakahɔe oko bidie ba boso ta ndako dja miongɔnɔ dja Bayuda ko bisika ba ekumu ta tɛkɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bakakatoe bali bagwa na bami leka la bobo ko, oko ta ehole ena, bakaongɔɔne miongɔɔnɔ miyai bɛngɛ babahokee. Badihabi esambi epipo mɛɛnɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epeeli ɛ motundu mwali ɔgwa na moomi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Bea, Yesu adaa ena ayɛli sanga ekaisebo bipeeli ta tepelo, ko ahokeaka moda maisaka bato falanga ena. Badiheli bike baisa falanga djike. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Motundu mwali ɔgwa na moomi aimea ko aisa pata dja bibende ba kɔngɔ ibae dja pɛpɛ motwuia. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Na bea Yesu abea batingami ba nde ko abala na bu boo: «Nabali na nu sooti: motundu mwali hoo ɔgwa na moomi aisi ta sanga obuke onɔdja bato bakina basusu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Tin'ɛ boo bato bakina bapi falanga idjidaki bo pɛpɛ okamba nadju; endolo yo, ta otundu ba nde, api odiheli ba nde bosusu bodaki na nde tin'ɛ ohela.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Obedjama ba tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:1-3">Mat 24, 1-3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Oko ena ɔdaka Yesu aimane ta tepelo, omɔti ɔ batingami ba nde abala na nde boo: «Molehi, hokea! Muu mondumba ma ndeke opele nda, bii biyoli binɛnɛnɛ nda!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Oeni biyoli bii binɛnɛnɛ? Pɛpɛ mondeke momɔti modikabi mobaki ta diko la mokina; isusu isopeanabi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimbete ba suka</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-9">Luk 21, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu adaa ta ngomba ɛ Olive ɛdaka eyɛlɛni na tepelo. Piɛlɛ, Djake, Yoani na Andele badaka oko ibo na nde ko bamohɔdja boo: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Lodjebedja ehole ekɔmɔbi midjɔ mia ko embete ndani einedjabi boo midjɔ mii misusu miboani makɔɔme?» <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Bea, Yesu abanga obala na bu boo: «Tomadingani boo moto omɔti ataokoseani. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bato bike badoabi na kombe ɛ mbai ko babalabi boo: “Nadi Masia!” Ko bakoseabi bato bike. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ehole eokabi no ngilimo dja bila na gala diko la bila dja ohali, pɛpɛ obangani; eboani boo midjɔ mia makɔɔme, endolo ena editi suka ɛ ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ekomi emɔti eonedjabi ekomi ekina, ko okumu bomɔti bonedjabi okumu bokina; kpɔtɔ ikumanabi ta bikenge ba ngondo bike, okeli bodabi ta ngondo. Edabi elengɛɛ ibange la epeko ɛ ibota. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Tina ɛ boono tomangatanani, baofundabini ta tibinalo, baobomabini pimbo ta ndako dja miɔngɔnɔ dja Bayuda, osambabini boso ba bagupunɛlɛ na bakumu ibanɛnɛ, edalea tina ɛ boono enɔli ɛ opa tati boso ba bobo. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Eboani boso mɛɛnɛ Mwako Mopele malehame ta bikomi bisusu ba ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ehole eokababini bo ta okɛɛ nanu ta tibinalo, pɛpɛ osatungeani boso ta tina ɛ eka eboani no obala; endolo balani oko bibaeli bipamabi na nu ta ehole ena, tin'ɛ boo editi ino ibabalabi, endolo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mwɛɛngɛ moto akababi mwanango ta ogwa, ko sɛngɛ moto akɔbi oko moda momɔti na mwana ɔ nde; bana batɔmbɔbi na baboti ba bobo ko babakababi ta ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Bato basusu baokeabini swɛ ta tin'ɛ kombe ɛ mbai. Endolo ona oikabi molema mbunoko o suka ahelabi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato banɔngɔbi obuke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24, 15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Ta ehole enɛbi no ona obeaka bo “Mbeedji ɔ manene”: bamodedjai ta esika edii yo pɛpɛ oboana bo adae. – Yɛɛ molangi adjebe! – Na bea, ibadabi ta Yuda batie ta ngomba; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />moto odabi osokolu awetebi ingea atomba leka lodii ta ndako; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />ko ona odabi ta gue asɔmbɛtebi ta ndako atomba mokoto ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ bali badabi na meemi na bii banungeabi bana ta maswi mia! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ongɔɔnɔni Ndjambe bɛngɛ boo midjɔ mia mitadoa ta ehole ɛ piɔ epipo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Tin'ɛ boo, ta maswi mia, ndjokwa enɛnɛ ɛ moda mua ɛipaka enɛmɛ boso donga ibange la ngondo ehole ɛyoa Ndjambe leka losusu, mbunoko hadɛdi, ko ekina ɛ mondumba mua edɛtebi koko. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Emiti daa boo Kumu akuhedjae ehole ena ɛ saya, pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti ohelabi. Endolo akuhedja maswi mia tin'ɛ bato ba nde ibahɔɔ yo.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ekadaa moto akabala nanu boo: “Hokea, Masia adii haa!” kaoko boo: “Hokea adii anaho!”, pɛpɛ omodhimeani. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Tin'ɛ boo bamasia ba okosa na batɛli ba okosa baenɛmɛbi bakobi midjɔ ma okamoa imiboani okosea bato ibahɔɔ Ndjambe, nga enɔli ekada. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Na bea, ino tomangatanani! Tin'ɛ boo naodjebedjaini misusu boso.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odoa ba Mwana ɔ moto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Endolo ta maswi mia, ngɔngɔ dja ehole ɛ monɔngɔ, diso la busa limeabi modidi, songe apɛtebi ohuu ba nde, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />ndjɔtɔ bakwabi donga busa, ko ngulu djidi o diko ikumanabi. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Bea, oenɛbini Mwana ɔ moto adoe ta diko la matute na ngulu enɛnɛ ko na ekumu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Alomabi babwɛndi ba nde ta makono manei ma ngondo mbunoko ta makono masusu ma busa tin'ɛ oputoanedja bato ibahɔɔ yo.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mole ma figi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-36">Mat 24, 32-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Djebani eleho edii opama na indjɛ la mole ma figi: bitape ba mu bikaɛmbɛ ko kasa dja yanie itɔi, odjebeni bo ehole epele edii mbuti. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Oko moda mua, ehole enɛbi no boo midjɔ mia mikokedjami, djebani boo odoa ba Mwana ɔ moto bobatami, boimei ta edipako. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nabali na nu sooti boo: bato bayangola hee batadimoa basusu boso ba boo midjɔ mia makokedjame. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Busa na kpɔtɔ lodimoabi, endolo bibaeli ba mbai binɔtebi noko osinɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjambe yo buki adjebi ehole ɛ suka</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24, 36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Ta tin'ɛ iswi kaoko ehole, moto omɔti tadjebe, ɛdae babwɛndi ta busa, noko na Mwana endolo Tata yo mɛɛnɛ adjebi.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Todingani! Pɛpɛ ohwɛni hiɔ, tin'ɛ boo otadjebakani ehole eimeabi iswi dia. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Edabi oko elengɛɛ moto akɛi ta mwɛngɔ: akini ndako ɛ nde ko api kpati ta mabɔ ma basali ba nde, api moto na moto mosala ma nde ko alomi sindjili ɔ edipako bo abanyee ndako opele. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Na bea, pɛpɛ ohwɛni, tin'ɛ boo otadjebakani iswi lihulabi moswa ndako: edabi ehole ekina mɔkɔmɔkɔ, kaoko ta ndanda ɛ bulu, kaoko ta kɔkɔ ɔ boso, kaoko sɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Daani na bɔɔ bo asaka okundumodjani ta ehole ehwɛlino hiɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Midjɔ mii mibali mbai na nu, na mibali na bato basusu boo: Pɛpɛ ohwɛni hiɔ!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bakumu baingei kuta diko la Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ɛdikaka oko maswi mabae boso ba tɛkɛ ɛ Pasika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pasika hee edii tina ɛ olɛdja oimana ba bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta Edjipito. </char></note> na tɛkɛ ɛ mapa imataki nɛngɛ mapa. Bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko bahombaka ndjia ɛopea Yesu na mbombi boo bamoowoe. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Bea, basabaleanaka ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Lotahɔnɔ okɔ modjɔ mua ta ehole ɛ tɛkɛ, ɛlɔkɛ boo bato basaka tɔmbɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali omɔti asopi malasi ta molo ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:36-50">Luk 7, 36-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu adaka ta Betania, ta ndako ɛ Simo moto ɔ mabha; ehole ɛdaka yo ta mesa, mwali omɔti aingea na molangi ma alabate molumake na malasi ma motwuia monɛnɛ, imakɔɔmɔ na kasa dja so epele dja mondjani ma nalade esɛnɔke. Abuka molangi ko asopa malasi ta molo ma Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bato bakina ibadaka ena basuboa ko basabaleana boo: «Tina ɛ onamea malasi mii ma so epele nda? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Bahɔnɔki otɛkɛ malasi mii onɔ pata mikama misato ma falanga tin'ɛ odjipa odii batundu!» Ko bahima mwali ona. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Endolo Yesu abala boo: «Mokinani ogoo. Tina ɛ monɔngɛdjaka na nu nda? Modjɔ mu mokokedjai yo tin'ɛ mbai modi mopele. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Tina ɛ boo odabini maswi masusu engbanga na batundu, ko ohɔni obakɔmɛini opele bihole bisusu ibipali no; endolo mbai, odaetebini na mbai bihole bisusu. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Akɔi mua mohɔni yo okɔ: abangi osuani malasi ta obɔngɛdja mokuku ma mbai tin'ɛ opuseama. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nabali nanu sooti boo: mɔɔngɔ masusu imalehabi bo Mwako Mopele, ta ngondo esusu, batɔndɔbi modjɔ mokɔi mwali hoo ko bamolɛdjakabi.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi adoi akaba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Na bea Yudasi Isikalioti, omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae, akɛɛ asoola na bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe bɛngɛ boo akabe Yesu ta mabɔ ma bobo. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ta ehole ɛ mooka bo, baluma na sepi enɛnɛ ko bamobunedja boo bamopɛ falanga. Ko Yudasi abanga ohomba enɔli epele tin'ɛ okaba Yesu ta mabɔ ma bobo.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na batingami ba nde bayaka mia ma Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Iswi la boso la tɛkɛ ɛ mapa imataki nɛngɛ mapa, busa ibanɔdjakabo mbeka ɛ bana ba bhata tin'ɛ mia ma Pasika, batingami ba Yesu bamohɔdja boo: «Esika ɛpalaka wɛ boo lakɛɛ aobɔngɛdja mia ma Pasika nda?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Na bea, Yesu aloma batingami ba nde babae, abala na bu boo: «Kɛɛni ta ibonga, osakaleani na moto omɔti alwali kulutu ɛ madiba. Mokimanani, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />ko ta esika eingealea yo, balani na moswa ndako boo: “Molehi ahɔdjai boo: Ekenge ɛ ndako eyakalea mbai mia ma Pasika na batingami ba mbai odii yo hɔɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ko aonedjaleani ta samba ɛ diko, ekenge ɛ ndako enɛnɛ eboanedjami, na midjɔ misusu mikokake. Edii ena, esika elobɔngɛdjaleano mia.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Batingami bakɛɛ, baimea ta ibonga; batanea misusu oko moda ma bala Yesu na bu, ko babɔngɛdja mia ma Pasika. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ɔimea mɔkɔmɔko, Yesu aimea engbanga na batingami ba nde doomi na babae. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ta ehole ɛdaka bo ta mesa ena baya, Yesu abala boo: «Nabali na nu, edii sooti: omɔti ɔ boono, ona ɔyaaka na mbai, akabaleani.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Batingami baimea na ndjokwa ko babanga omohɔdja omɔti ngɔngɔ dja okina boo: «Edii mbai?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii omɔti ta ndanda boono, doomi na babae, ona ɔdubeaka na mbai mapa ta saani. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Sooti, Mwana ɔ moto agwalea oko moda mabala Makomi tina ɛ nde, endolo ndjokwa ndani odii ona okabi Mwana ɔ moto! Ɛnɔkɔ na opele boo moto ona adae pɛpɛ obotama!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa ɛ Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22, 15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ehole ɛdaka bo bayaka, Yesu atomba ipa ko, ngɔngɔ dja osakoa Ndjambe, alibuka ko alipa odi batingami ba nde; abala na bu boo: «Tombani, hee edii mokuku ma mbai.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Atomba koko kɔbɔ ɛ vino ko, ngɔngɔ dja osakoa Ndjambe, abapa yo, ko bayemwa ibo basusu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Hee edii makia ma mbai, makia ma edhimaneli, imasopei tin'ɛ bato bike. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nabali na nu sooti boo: Nawetebi mwa koko vino mbunoko iswi limwabi mbai vino ɛyanie ta Okumu ba Ndjambe.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ngɔngɔ djia baemba biembo, bea bakɛɛ ta ngomba ɛ Olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai boo Piɛlɛ amoinganalea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Ino basusu otialeanini, moda makomama mo boo: “Nabomalea mobanyeli ɔ bingbɛndɛ, ko bhata bananganalea ngise djisusu”. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Endolo, Yesu abakea boo, ngɔngɔ dja opusoa bambai, nakɛlea aombani ta Galilai.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Noko bakina bakaosundola, mbai naosundoletelea.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Bea Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabali na wɛ sooti: busabu, ta bulu bu mɛɛnɛ, boso ba kɔkɔ okɔkɔlɔ mbala ibae, wɛ, oinganaleani mbala isato boo todjebeni.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Endolo Piɛlɛ andindimedjai obala boo: «Nitameka noko osinɛɛ oingana boo teodjebe, noko ekada boo nagwɛ nɔsɔ wɛ.» Ko batingami bakina babala oko moda mua momɔti.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongɔɔni ta Getesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ngɔngɔ djia baimea ta esika ɛbiamaka Getesemane, ko Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Dikani haa, ta ehole edalea mbai naongɔɔnɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Bea akɛɛ engbanga emɔti na Piɛlɛ, Djake na Yoani. Abanga odaa na bɔɔ ko na okɛsɛli, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />ko abala na bu boo: «Molema ma mbai molumi na ndjokwa ɛ ogwa; dikani haa ko pɛpɛ ohwɛni.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Asatswa maa ohali na batingami, asadumba ta kpɔtɔ ko aongɔɔnɔ Ndjambe boo, ekaboana, ehole hee ɛ saya ɛsasue na nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Abala boo: «Sesa, odii wɛ misusu miboani okɔɔmɔ; dongedja mbuti nambai kɔbɔ hee ɛ saya. Noko bea, titi moda mapalaka mbai, endolo moda mapalaka wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Yesu asɔmbɔ mbala ekina odii batingami ba nde basato ko abatanea bahwɛli. Abala na Piɛlɛ boo: «Simo, ohwɛkɛ? Ohɔniti noko oda mɔsu ehole emɔti? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Pɛpɛ ohwɛni ko ongɔɔnɔni, bɛngɛ boo osakakwani ta omekama. Mwembo molumi na posa, endolo muni modii na bwɛmbu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Asasua mbala ekina ko asɔmbɔ oongɔnɔ oko moda maongɔnɔkɔ yo boso. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Na bea asɔmbɔ koko mbuti na batingami ba nde ko abatanea bahwɛli; miso ma bobo maimeaka mandi. Baidiha eka ɛ omosɔmbɛdja. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ehole ɛsɔmbɔ yo tin'ɛ mbala ɛ basato, abala na bu boo: «Ohwɛlini oko hiɔ ko odini oko ta iheme? Modjɔ mosi! Ehole eimei. Hadɛdi, Mwana ɔ moto akabamalea ta mabɔ ma bato ba masumu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Emani, lakɛɛ! Hokeani, mokabi ɔ mbai abatami!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opeama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-12">Yoa 18, 2-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Oko ena ɔdaka Yesu abala, Yudasi aimea, omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae. Emumu ɛ bato ibapeaka mipata na mangenda badaka na nde engbanga emɔti. Balomama na bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na basuku. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yudasi, ona ɔbakabea Yesu, abapa embete: «Moto ona obhimbalea mbai, edii yo. Mopeani, kɛɛni na nde mobanyeani opele.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ehole ɛimea Yudasi, asabatea na Yesu ko abala na nde boo: «Molehi!» Ko amobhimba. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Oko ena, bakina baisa mabɔ diko la Yesu ko bamopea. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Endolo omɔti ɔ bia ibadaka ena aihwa mopata, aboma mobuli ɔ nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe ko amokɛsɛ itoi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Odoini apeani na mipata ko na mangenda elengɛɛ boo nadii motɔmbɔki? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Maswi masusu nadaka na nu engbanga, nalehaka ta tepelo, ko ɔipeakanini. Endolo mu mokɔɔmi bɛngɛ boo Makomi makokedjame.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Bea batingami basusu bamosundola ko batia. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Mwenga moomi omɔti atingama ngɔngɔ dja Yesu, alwali molekani. Ehole ɛmopeabo, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />abasundolea molekani ko atia.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso ba tibinalo eenɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26, 57-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22, 54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18, 13-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bakɛɛ na Yesu odii nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe, oho ɔbolama bakumu babanganga ba Ndjambe, basuku na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Piɛlɛ akimana Yesu ohali ko aingea ta tiangando ɛ opango banganga ɔ Ndjambe o monɛnɛ. Oho, adaa esika emɔti na babaneli aoka mosa. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ena bea, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato basusu ba tibinalo eenɛnɛ ɛ Bayuda bahombaka tati ebe diko la Yesu bɛngɛ bamopɛ etumbu ɛ ogwa, endolo baiyediha. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Na bea, bato bike, badoa na tati dja okosa tin'ɛ Yesu, endolo ibo basusu baidaka kɔpɛ emɔti. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Na tina hee, bato bakina baema ko bakosa na Yesu midjɔ boo: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Lamooka abala boo: “Mbai nabukabi tepelo hee epikama na bato ko ngɔngɔ dja maswi masato, napikabi ekina ena edabi pɛpɛ oda mosala ma mabɔ ma bato.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Endolo noko diko la tati ena baibalaka monɔkɔ momɔti. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Na bea, nganga ɔ Ndjambe o monɛnɛ aema ta ndanda ɛ ikita ko ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Oditi na kɔpɛ ɛ osɔmbɛdja diko la tati dja bato bii odii wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Endolo Yesu apɔpɔnɔ, aisɔmbɛdja noko eka. Nganga ɔ Ndjambe o monɛnɛ amohɔdja koko boo: «Odii Masia, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe ona okakumedjae so?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Oko bea, edii mbai, ko oenɛbini ino basusu Mwana ɔ moto adii ta ebɔ ɛ bami ɛ Ndjambe ɔ ngulu; omoenɛbini koko adoe ta matute ma busa.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Na bea, nganga ɔ Ndjambe o monɛnɛ akala bisendja ba nde ko abala boo: «Loditi koko na tina e batemo! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ino mɛɛnɛ ookini moda mokotoi yo Ndjambe. Malɛi ma boono madii nda?» Ibo basusu babala ohuu boo akwii na ikambo ko aboani na etumbu ɛ ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bakina ta ndanda ɛ bobo babanga otɔɔ Yesu masɔi, bahua mbanda ɛ nde, bamoboma makɔfi ko babala na nde boo: «Lodjebedja moto okɔi modjɔ mua!» Ko babaneli batomba Yesu ko bamoboma bipataka.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26, 69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22, 56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoa 18, 15-18</ref>. <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Piɛlɛ adaka oko o nase ta tiangando ɛ opango. Mosali omɔti mwali ɔ nganga ɔ Ndjambe o monɛnɛ aimea. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Aeni Piɛlɛ aoka mosa, amosisimodjai ko abali na nde boo: «Wɛ koko, ɔdaka na Yesu, moto ɔ Nasaleta.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Endolo Piɛlɛ amoinganea abala ohuu boo: «Natadjebaka modjɔ mapalaka wɛ ɔbale, nitamosipoaka.» Bea aimana ta tiangando ko aemaa ta eingeli ɛ opango. Kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Endolo, mosali mwali amoenɛ ko asɔmbɛɛ boso ba bato ibadaka ena boo: «Moto hoo adii omɔti ɔ bobo!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ko Piɛlɛ aingana mbala ekina. Ɔnɔɔ ma yumbu, bato ibadaka ena babala koko na Piɛlɛ boo: «Sooti mɛɛnɛ, odii omɔti ɔ bobo, tin'ɛ bo, wɛ koko, odii Mogalilai.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Bea Piɛlɛ abala na ngulu boo: «Yɛɛ boo Ndjambe apɛni etumbu ekada boo nakosi! Nakati seleka, natadjebaka moto ona ɔbalaka no.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Oko ta ehole ena, kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔ mbala ɛ babae, ko Piɛlɛ alɛdja moda mabala Yesu na nde boo: «Boso bo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle mbala ibae, oinganaleani mbala isato bo todjebeni.» Bea, Piɛlɛ abanga oyea.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso ba Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Sɔɔ mɛɛnɛ, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe baputoana engbanga na basuku, na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko, ɛpalaka ɛbale boo tibinalo enɛnɛ esusu. Bananga Yesu mbɔti, bakɛɛ na nde odii Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato amohɔdja boo: «Odii kumu ɔ Bayuda?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Obali bea.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe bapunda Yesu na midjɔ mike. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Na bea, Pilato amohɔdja naikina boo: «Wɛ oditi na kopɛ ɛ osɔmbɛdja? Otaokaka mii maopundaka bo!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Endolo Yesu aisɔmbɛdja noko kopɛ emɔti, Pilato akamoa na modjɔ mua.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adihi etumbu ɛ ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoa 18, 39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Eengi tɛkɛ ɛ Pasika, Pilato adaka aimusedja moto ɔ bɔlɔkɔ omɔti, ona ɔsɛngɛkɛ bato. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Bea, ta ehole ena moto omɔti adaka ta bɔlɔkɔ ɔbeaka bo Balaba engbanga na bakina bato tin'ɛ bo baowa moto ta ehole ɛ wusuwusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Emumu ɛ bato ɛkɛɛ ta ndako ɛ Pilato ko babanga omosɛngɛ boo abakɔe modjɔ imadjebeana na nde obakɔmɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɔpalakani boo naotingoeni kumu ɔ Bayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Adjebaka opele boo bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe bapunda Yesu odii yo tin'ɛ ikuwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Endolo bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe bapa simbisi odii bato basusu basɛngɛ Pilato abatingoe Balaba ta esika ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato abahɔdja mbala ekina boo: «Ɛpalaka no nakɔe yee na moto hoo odii no obea kumu ɔ Bayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bamosɔmbɛdja na ogama boo: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato abahɔdja boo: «Obe bokɔi yo nda?» Endolo bagama koko na ngulu boo: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Ta tin'ɛ osepedja emumu ɛ bato Pilato abatingoa Balaba; ngɔngɔ djia abomedja Yesu pimbo ko abapa yo boo bamobake ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basoda basɛki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Basoda bakɛɛ na Yesu ta ndako ɛ gupunɛlɛ ta esika ɛ esambi, ko babea basoda basusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bamolwɛdja mokoto mokpetu, bayoa egbala ɛ ndjubɛ ko bamobakea yo ta molo. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ngɔngɔ djia, babanga omoisia boo: «Bwanda, kumu ɔ Bayuda!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ko bamobhimboa mokɛɛlɛ ta molo, bamotɔɔ masɔi ko badaa magunda bɛngɛ basuname boso ba nde. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ehole ɛbɛtɛ bo omosɛkɛ bamoihwa mokoto mokpetu ko bamosɔmbɛdja bisendja ba nde. Ngɔngɔ djia baimana na nde o sokolu ɛ opango bɛngɛ boo bamobake ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Moto omɔti ɔ Kulene, kombe ɛ nde Simo, sɛngɛ Alekidjandele na Lufusu, anɔkɔ ena ta ihule la nde ta gue. Basoda bamopea na ngulu bɛngɛ boo atombe ekulusu ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bakɛɛ na Yesu ta esika ebeaka bo Gologota, etingodjai boo «Esika ɛ engbongolo ɛ molo.» <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bapalaka bamopɛ vino eputoanake na bole ba otitedja saya, endolo Yesu alona oye mwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ngɔngɔ djia bamobaka ta ekulusu ko basakaanea bisendja ba nde na ndjia ɛ djonga bɛngɛ badjebe eka edihalea moto na moto. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ɛdaka ehole ɛ ibua ɛ sɔɔ ena ɔbakama yo ta ekulusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Bakoma tina ɛ modjɔ imagwa na nde ta maa yaale ɔ ibaya diko la ekulusu boo: «Kumu ɔ Bayuda». <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bato babae ba babakama na nde engbanga emɔti ta ekulusu, omɔti ta ebɔ ɛnde ɛ bami ko okina ta ebɔ ɛnde ɛ bali. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Edii okokedjama ba Makomi imabala ohuu boo: «Alangama ta motwuia ma bato babe.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Minɔ na ndjia bamosingaka ena bakumana melo babalaka na nde boo: «Aa! Wɛ titi ɔbalaka boo obukalea tepelo ko opikalea ekina ngɔngɔ dja maswi masato, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />saheledja wɛ mɛɛnɛ, tita ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Moda momɔti na bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko basɛkɛkɛ Yesu ko basabaleanaka boo: «Aheledjaka bato bakina, endolo atahɔnɔ osaheledja yo mɛɛnɛ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Yɛɛ Masia, kumu ɔ Isalɛlɛ atite hadɛdi ta ekulusu! Lokaenɛlea modjɔ mua, lomodhimalea!» Bato ibabakama na nde ta ekulusu bamosingaka koko.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogwa ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Donga ndanda ɛ busa mbunoko ehole ɛ basato ɛ mɔkɔmɔkɔ, modidi makwa ta ngando esusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ko ta ehole ena ɛ basato ɛ mɔkɔmɔkɔ, Yesu agama na ngulu boo: «Eli, Eli, lama sabakatani?» – Etingodjai boo: «Ndjambe ɔ mbai, Ndjambe ɔ mbai, osundolini tina nda?» – <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bato bakina ibadaka ena, baoka ko bagama boo: «Hokamedjani, abeaka Elia!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Omɔti ɔ bobo apeta alumedja imbusu na vino ɛ ngai ko alitingea ta sɔngɔ ɛ mokɛɛlɛ, bea alilɛkɛɛ odii Yesu bɛngɛ amwɛ ko abala boo: «Kinani, laindje kaoko Elia adoalea amotitedja ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Endolo Yesu agama na ngulu ko agwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Lido ɛdaka esɛpi ta tepelo ɛsaola biale bibae donga odiko mbunoko o nase. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Kapitɛni ɔ basoda ɔ Baloma ona ɔdaka aemi boso ba Yesu aenɛ moda magwa yo ko abala boo: «Sooti mɛɛnɛ, moto hoo adaka Mwana ɔ Ndjambe!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Bali bakina ibadaka ena, ibo koko baenɛkɛ ohali. Ta ndanda ɛ bobo, ɛdaka ena Malia ɔ Magadala, Malia, nɛngɛ Djake o yɛngɛ na Yose, na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bakimana Yesu ko bamokɔmɛdja ehole ɛdaka yo ta Galilai. Ɛdaka ena koko na bali bakina bike ibakɛɛ na nde ta Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapusei Yesu ta ikila</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ɔimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ, iswi la mosalingo ma tɛkɛ ibange la sabata. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Ehole ɛimea Yosepu ɔ Alimate, omɔti ɔsumaka bo ta tibinalo enɛnɛ, yo alɛndɛkɛ koko odoa ba Okumu ba Ndjambe. Yosepu aibanga okɛ odii Pilato asɛngɛ mokuku ma Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Endolo Pilato akamoa ɔɔka yo boo Yesu agwi. Abea kapitɛni ɔ basoda ko amohɔdja kaoko Yesu asi ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ngɔngɔ dja esɔmbɛdjɛli ɛ kapitɛni ɔ basoda, apa enɔli odii Yosepu bo atombe ndjemba ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosepu asomba molekani ma motwuia, atitedja ndjemba ɛ Yesu ta ekulusu, ayehua ko ayepusea ta ikila ilalongea yo ta mondeke monɛnɛ. Ngɔngɔ djia ahilingoanedja mondeke imabɔngɛdjama tin'ɛ odipa eingeli ɛ mobombo. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia ɔ Magadala na Malia nɛngɛ Yose badaka bahokea esika ɛsambea bo Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Opusoama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-11">Luk 24, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-2">Yoa 20, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ɔnɔɔ iswi la sabata, Malia ɔ Magadala, Malia nɛngɛ Djake na Salome basomba malasi ma so epele bɛngɛ bakɛɛ asua ndjemba ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ta iswi la mbangi ɛ eyenga, sɔɔ mɛɛnɛ, ta imane la diso la busa, bakɛɛ ta esɛmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Basabaleanaka boo: «Olohilingoanedjalea mondeke modipi eingeli ɛ esɛmɔ nda?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Endolo ɔhokea bo, baenɛ boo mondeke, monɛnɛ, mahilingoana yɛɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ɔingea bo ta esɛmɔ; baenɛ mwenga moomi, adii ta ebɔ ɛ bami, alwali mokoto mopu, ko badaa na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Endolo mwenga ona abala na bu boo: «Pɛpɛ obangani, ɔhombakani Yesu ɔ Nasaleta, hoo obakaki bo ta ekulusu; apusoi, aditi haa. Hokeani esika emosambeaki bo. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Kɛɛ atɔndɔeni hadɛdi batingami ba nde, na Piɛlɛ koko boo: “Yesu akɛi aombani ta Galilai; omoenɛleani oho oko moda mabala yo na nu.”» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Bea baimana ta esɛmɔ ko batia ohali, badaka bangongome na bɔɔ. Ko baitɔndɔ noko moto omɔti tin'ɛ badaka na bɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai odii Malia ɔ Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoa 20, 11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ngɔngɔ dja opusoa ba Yesu sɔɔ ɛ iswi la mbangi la eyenga, asaenɛmɛdja boso mɛɛnɛ odii Malia ɔ Magadala, ona obengana yo miembo mibe saambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Akɛɛ atɔndɔ gala ena odii bato ibadalaka na Yesu. Badaka na ndjokwa ko bayea. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Endolo ehole ɛoka bo abala boo: «Yesu apusoi, namoeni!» Baimodhimea.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai odii batingami babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24, 13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu asaenɛmɛdja na moda mokina odii batingami babae ibadaka bakɛɛ ta ngando. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Batingami bia basɔmbɔ ko batɔndɔ bakina, baibadhima noko osinɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai odii batingami doomi na omɔti</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mis 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu asaenɛmɛdja na batingami doomi na omɔti ta ehole ɛdaka bo bayaka; abapɛlɛ diko la taka ɛ bobo ɛ edhimeli ko na milema ma bobo mipipo odii bii ibamoenɛ ngɔngɔ dja opusoa ba nde. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Bea abala na bu boo: «Kɛɛni ta ngondo esusu ko lehani Mwako Mopele odii bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Moto ona odhimabi ko oinamabi ahelabi; endolo ona odabi pɛpɛ odhima adihabi etumbu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ko hokeani bimbete ibienɛmɛbi odii bato ibadhimabi: babenganabi miembo mibe ta kombe ɛ mbai; babalabi kɔpɛ dja yanie; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />bakapea ndjɔ na mabɔ ma bobo, kaoko bakamwa moselo, modjɔ mobe motakɔmɔ na bu; babakeabi mabɔ diko la bato ba bipeko, bahelabi.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbi odii Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24, 50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mis 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala na bu bea, Kumu Yesu aihwea ta busa ko adaa ta ebɔ ɛ bami ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Batingami bakɛɛ aleha Mwako Mopele mɔɔngɔ masusu. Kumu asalaka nabu engbanga ko aenɛmɛdjaka sooti ɛ ebaeli ɛ bobo na ndjia ɛ bimbete ba okamoa ibakɔkɔ bo.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>